(3264343, 455918, 41337, '<td valign="top">I tried shooting some birds for this challenge and found it to be quite challenging. I would have loved to have gotten a shot like this. Good luck!</td>', 'I tried shooting some birds for this challenge and found it to be quite challenging. I would have loved to have gotten a shot like this. Good luck!', '2007-01-22 00:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
