(3264582, 456115, 52130, '<td valign="top">Well <i>this</i> looks familiar!<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=435937" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/52130/thumb/435937.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/52130/thumb/435937.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/52130/thumb/435937.jpg"/></a> <br/>:)<br/>good job!</td>', 'Well this looks familiar! :)good job!', '2007-01-22 00:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3264618, 456511, 60195, '<td valign="top">A gorgeous shot with so many awesome elements. Likely would''ve ribboned if you''d have fixed the horizon :o\</td>', 'A gorgeous shot with so many awesome elements. Likely would''ve ribboned if you''d have fixed the horizon :o\', '2007-01-22 01:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3264627, 456145, 29269, '<td valign="top">The photo lacks important details and is overwhelmed with the branches (unimportant distractions).<br/>Unfortunately, there are too many branches to make me believe that this image would ever show up in a wildlife magazine (which would warrant a 9 or a 10).<br/> <br/>The highlights also seem overblown, either as a result of excessive contrast/brightness adjustment, or as a result of overexposure.<br/> <br/>Good luck!</td>', 'The photo lacks important details and is overwhelmed with the branches (unimportant distractions).Unfortunately, there are too many branches to make me believe that this image would ever show up in a wildlife magazine (which would warrant a 9 or a 10). The highlights also seem overblown, either as a result of excessive contrast/brightness adjustment, or as a result of overexposure. Good luck!', '2007-01-22 01:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3264639, 456512, 64994, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I gave this a 4, too dark and not enough contrast...</td>', 'Sorry, I gave this a 4, too dark and not enough contrast...', '2007-01-22 01:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3264641, 455658, 58047, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot, love the eye contact the pose, and the clouds behind. My one niggle is that the top right antler has been cut off.</td>', 'Awesome shot, love the eye contact the pose, and the clouds behind. My one niggle is that the top right antler has been cut off.', '2007-01-22 01:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3264643, 456511, 64994, '<td valign="top">Awesome...</td>', 'Awesome...', '2007-01-22 01:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3264650, 455941, 58047, '<td valign="top">Absolutely adorable, love it.. sooo cute!</td>', 'Absolutely adorable, love it.. sooo cute!', '2007-01-22 01:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3264653, 456391, 64994, '<td valign="top">7, great shot, too bad the branch was in the way of the tail feathers but still a great shot!!!</td>', '7, great shot, too bad the branch was in the way of the tail feathers but still a great shot!!!', '2007-01-22 01:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3264662, 455658, 29269, '<td valign="top">Hahn? If this is not Richard, then someone must have been walking on Hahn''s turf and shooting his bucks.<br/>This is the true candidate for the front page. Good luck!</td>', 'Hahn? If this is not Richard, then someone must have been walking on Hahn''s turf and shooting his bucks.This is the true candidate for the front page. Good luck!', '2007-01-22 01:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3264667, 455826, 41337, '<td valign="top">Looks like that bird is downhill skiing. Great capture!</td>', 'Looks like that bird is downhill skiing. Great capture!', '2007-01-22 01:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3264669, 455658, 30861, '<td valign="top">The tone mapping, if that''s what you used, is leaving artificial looking areas around the horns. The end result is almost like looking at a Diorama of an elk in a natural history museum. At the same time it''s a really striking image. But it''s hard to be sure if that''s a live or a dead animal, the tonal balance is so unnatural. I''m assuming it''s live because the fur doesn''t look groomed. I wish I didn''t have this ambivalence about the unnatural evenness of BG and subject. I wish the BG were a stop brighter than it is. Sigh. Good luck!</td>', 'The tone mapping, if that''s what you used, is leaving artificial looking areas around the horns. The end result is almost like looking at a Diorama of an elk in a natural history museum. At the same time it''s a really striking image. But it''s hard to be sure if that''s a live or a dead animal, the tonal balance is so unnatural. I''m assuming it''s live because the fur doesn''t look groomed. I wish I didn''t have this ambivalence about the unnatural evenness of BG and subject. I wish the BG were a stop brighter than it is. Sigh. Good luck!', '2007-01-22 01:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3264673, 456552, 29269, '<td valign="top">Hi neighbor!<br/>Nice find of this young buck, and thank goodness for sunny sunday! Centered composition is a bit dissapointing, but everything else is there.</td>', 'Hi neighbor!Nice find of this young buck, and thank goodness for sunny sunday! Centered composition is a bit dissapointing, but everything else is there.', '2007-01-22 01:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3264676, 455462, 64994, '<td valign="top">Is this the Livingston Seagull?? 7</td>', 'Is this the Livingston Seagull?? 7', '2007-01-22 01:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3264677, 455658, 41337, '<td valign="top">Wow. Great capture. I''m amazed at the type of background you managed to include in the shot.</td>', 'Wow. Great capture. I''m amazed at the type of background you managed to include in the shot.', '2007-01-22 01:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3264685, 454073, 64994, '<td valign="top">Fastest bird on earth...8</td>', 'Fastest bird on earth...8', '2007-01-22 01:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3264687, 456429, 41337, '<td valign="top">Impeccable shot! I just wish it didn''t have that "pet shot in a studio" feel to this.</td>', 'Impeccable shot! I just wish it didn''t have that "pet shot in a studio" feel to this.', '2007-01-22 01:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3264688, 455358, 30861, '<td valign="top">The tone mapping on this is not working well, creating unnatural BG dullness and flatness and pronounced haloing of the birds. The shot is otherwise quite endearing.</td>', 'The tone mapping on this is not working well, creating unnatural BG dullness and flatness and pronounced haloing of the birds. The shot is otherwise quite endearing.', '2007-01-22 01:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3264690, 456734, 29269, '<td valign="top">Ant wouldn''t be included in the challenge... although even if I forget about the dnmc, it ends up being technically poorly executed photo, with no detauls on the animal that seems out of focus, and that blotch of white flash is sure to distract and dissapoint even the most friendly viewer.</td>', 'Ant wouldn''t be included in the challenge... although even if I forget about the dnmc, it ends up being technically poorly executed photo, with no detauls on the animal that seems out of focus, and that blotch of white flash is sure to distract and dissapoint even the most friendly viewer.', '2007-01-22 01:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
