(3264709, 455146, 29269, '<td valign="top">You had a great shot, nice composition and interesting behavior, but you ruined it with postprocessing. (I hope that you started with a good image, it would be worth posting your original in a thread after the challenge and asking for suggestions on how to process it better).<br/>Oversharpening is evident, and serves no purpose - does not enhance the photo at all.</td>', 'You had a great shot, nice composition and interesting behavior, but you ruined it with postprocessing. (I hope that you started with a good image, it would be worth posting your original in a thread after the challenge and asking for suggestions on how to process it better).Oversharpening is evident, and serves no purpose - does not enhance the photo at all.', '2007-01-22 01:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
