(3265202, 456475, 5034, '<td valign="top">DNMC to me, the challenge does state to get non domesticated mammals, birds, reptiles and amphibians living in a natural environment.  You''ve got the environment down pat, for which I will give you 4, but you''re missing the key element - the bird/s.</td>', 'DNMC to me, the challenge does state to get non domesticated mammals, birds, reptiles and amphibians living in a natural environment.  You''ve got the environment down pat, for which I will give you 4, but you''re missing the key element - the bird/s.', '2007-01-22 06:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
