(3265632, 454469, 65234, '<td valign="top">Rather small.  I''m sure I''m not going to be the only one to mention that, but it does make it difficult to really evaluate the picture.</td>', 'Rather small.  I''m sure I''m not going to be the only one to mention that, but it does make it difficult to really evaluate the picture.', '2007-01-22 09:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
