(3265751, 456309, 61155, '<td valign="top">Fantastic!! Beautiful composition. Bang on timing on your part. Such a sweet image.</td>', 'Fantastic!! Beautiful composition. Bang on timing on your part. Such a sweet image.', '2007-01-22 09:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3265780, 456305, 66201, '<td valign="top">Don''t know - while a spectacular subject, the face on doesn''t do him justice. He looks stocky, and fat, not powerful and agile. The positioning of the tiger to the left is interesting, but I think it''s a bit extreme. I understand that you were trying to show the natural environment around him, but perhaps it''s too much? Just my opinion anyway. Still striking and nice palette.</td>', 'Don''t know - while a spectacular subject, the face on doesn''t do him justice. He looks stocky, and fat, not powerful and agile. The positioning of the tiger to the left is interesting, but I think it''s a bit extreme. I understand that you were trying to show the natural environment around him, but perhaps it''s too much? Just my opinion anyway. Still striking and nice palette.', '2007-01-22 09:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3265785, 454979, 66201, '<td valign="top">Ah, I wish the tail had not been cropped/cut off. I find the balance in the composition a bit awkward. Very sweet subject and nice clarity.</td>', 'Ah, I wish the tail had not been cropped/cut off. I find the balance in the composition a bit awkward. Very sweet subject and nice clarity.', '2007-01-22 09:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3265790, 456422, 66201, '<td valign="top">A glorious subject for the challenge. Nice tones.</td>', 'A glorious subject for the challenge. Nice tones.', '2007-01-22 09:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3265796, 456705, 66201, '<td valign="top">A perfect family group!maybe a bit more contrast or a tighter zoom in? Something to bring out clarity and majesty?</td>', 'A perfect family group!maybe a bit more contrast or a tighter zoom in? Something to bring out clarity and majesty?', '2007-01-22 09:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3265798, 456129, 66201, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous..might have done with some dodging around the eyes: a cheat I know, but it would have accentuated them and made them a focal point. I love these beasties...from my neck of the woods! :-)</td>', 'Gorgeous..might have done with some dodging around the eyes: a cheat I know, but it would have accentuated them and made them a focal point. I love these beasties...from my neck of the woods! :-)', '2007-01-22 09:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
