(3267323, 455918, 66201, '<td valign="top">Lovely soft image: it''s warm, "Gentle" and precious. Wonderful work.</td>', 'Lovely soft image: it''s warm, "Gentle" and precious. Wonderful work.', '2007-01-22 15:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267334, 456775, 54475, '<td valign="top">This is so beautiful I love this picture 10</td>', 'This is so beautiful I love this picture 10', '2007-01-22 15:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267335, 456231, 5034, '<td valign="top">That''s the idea I started with!  looks a bit too green to be it''s natural habitat - and I do know, my uncle''s farm borders on a wildlife sanctuary and it is certainly not green up there now!  EDIT TO ADD Upon reflection, down in Albany or Augusta or somewhere down that area there may still be green grass. Aweseome shot, exactly what I wanted to do initially but couldnt really pull it off with my p.o.s., 10 for you, great aussie shot!</td>', 'That''s the idea I started with!  looks a bit too green to be it''s natural habitat - and I do know, my uncle''s farm borders on a wildlife sanctuary and it is certainly not green up there now!  EDIT TO ADD Upon reflection, down in Albany or Augusta or somewhere down that area there may still be green grass. Aweseome shot, exactly what I wanted to do initially but couldnt really pull it off with my p.o.s., 10 for you, great aussie shot!', '2007-01-22 15:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267337, 456723, 66201, '<td valign="top">Phew...seems dangerously close: read of a woman who had her nose bitten off last year by a seal!!! She was trying to rescue it. The setting gives this so much atmosphere: cold and wet.</td>', 'Phew...seems dangerously close: read of a woman who had her nose bitten off last year by a seal!!! She was trying to rescue it. The setting gives this so much atmosphere: cold and wet.', '2007-01-22 15:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267340, 454038, 44877, '<td valign="top">Wow - that takes the cake. Excellent shot!</td>', 'Wow - that takes the cake. Excellent shot!', '2007-01-22 15:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267344, 455715, 66201, '<td valign="top">I think I may have cropped off the white wall through the grid on the right..? But  lovely fresh, sharp capture.</td>', 'I think I may have cropped off the white wall through the grid on the right..? But  lovely fresh, sharp capture.', '2007-01-22 15:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
