(3267357, 456498, 66597, '<td valign="top">I love the way you captured his environment. This is a saguaro? I would have considered a little dodging on his face to bring the whites out, but still a really nice photo.</td>', 'I love the way you captured his environment. This is a saguaro? I would have considered a little dodging on his face to bring the whites out, but still a really nice photo.', '2007-01-22 15:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
