(3267362, 456274, 55956, '<td valign="top">great image and very great light. I think,and hope, that you have captured this image in the wild. perhaps there isn''t the best focus possible and the best sharpnes possible but for this reasons I think that isn''t a shot in a zoo. 9.</td>', 'great image and very great light. I think,and hope, that you have captured this image in the wild. perhaps there isn''t the best focus possible and the best sharpnes possible but for this reasons I think that isn''t a shot in a zoo. 9.', '2007-01-22 15:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
