(3267378, 453865, 70369, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot. What a pose.. It''s almost as if it knew you were there &amp; he/she was showing off their beauty for you. Well done.</td>', 'This is a great shot. What a pose.. It''s almost as if it knew you were there & he/she was showing off their beauty for you. Well done.', '2007-01-22 15:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
