(3267385, 456475, 70369, '<td valign="top">hmm, not sure if I''m missing the wildlife in this one. I''m staring, now glaring, nope.. No animal.. Other than that, it''s a nice shot. I like the position of the nest and the branches around it, gives us an idea of where it was living.</td>', 'hmm, not sure if I''m missing the wildlife in this one. I''m staring, now glaring, nope.. No animal.. Other than that, it''s a nice shot. I like the position of the nest and the branches around it, gives us an idea of where it was living.', '2007-01-22 15:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267389, 455513, 55956, '<td valign="top">mmmmm....do you have a 10000000 mm lens? :) I suspect that you have captured the image in a zoo. the image is good but without great sharpness. 7</td>', 'mmmmm....do you have a 10000000 mm lens? :) I suspect that you have captured the image in a zoo. the image is good but without great sharpness. 7', '2007-01-22 15:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
