(3267478, 454522, 55956, '<td valign="top">terrific scene 10</td>', 'terrific scene 10', '2007-01-22 16:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267479, 455882, 45631, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. 8</td>', 'Nice shot. 8', '2007-01-22 16:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267484, 455817, 45631, '<td valign="top">Like the contrast of light to dark in this shot. 9</td>', 'Like the contrast of light to dark in this shot. 9', '2007-01-22 16:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267492, 456566, 65234, '<td valign="top">The processing/effect seems at odds with the subject, who is placidly swimming and seemingly unaware of whatever zoomy thing is going on unconnected to his movement.  While it generally focusses attention on the duck, there are a few pretty clear branches caught in the maelstrom which also grab the eye. The overall effect is not pleasing to me.</td>', 'The processing/effect seems at odds with the subject, who is placidly swimming and seemingly unaware of whatever zoomy thing is going on unconnected to his movement.  While it generally focusses attention on the duck, there are a few pretty clear branches caught in the maelstrom which also grab the eye. The overall effect is not pleasing to me.', '2007-01-22 16:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267494, 455658, 45631, '<td valign="top">Would have liked the tip of the antler in but apart from that - lovely. 10</td>', 'Would have liked the tip of the antler in but apart from that - lovely. 10', '2007-01-22 16:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267517, 456311, 45631, '<td valign="top">lovely composition and color 9</td>', 'lovely composition and color 9', '2007-01-22 16:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267526, 456446, 65234, '<td valign="top">I was expecting a ducky, maybe, but not a woody.  They''re domesticated for sure (and yes, you made me go look up the Latin!).</td>', 'I was expecting a ducky, maybe, but not a woody.  They''re domesticated for sure (and yes, you made me go look up the Latin!).', '2007-01-22 16:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267529, 456512, 55600, '<td valign="top">Little too dark</td>', 'Little too dark', '2007-01-22 16:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267530, 456445, 23484, '<td valign="top">Outstanding shot.  The capture is great and so is the detail. 8</td>', 'Outstanding shot.  The capture is great and so is the detail. 8', '2007-01-22 16:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267533, 456740, 45519, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed/cropped and I like the detail ... very sharp subject.  The floating feather(s) make me chuckle for some reason, like this poor guy is going bald just standing there (he''s static yet feathers are falling).  The biggest detractor is the treatment/toning, which is too purple for my taste.  I''d love to see this in either color or a more neutrally toned b&amp;w.  Nice capture nonetheless.</td>', 'Nicely composed/cropped and I like the detail ... very sharp subject.  The floating feather(s) make me chuckle for some reason, like this poor guy is going bald just standing there (he''s static yet feathers are falling).  The biggest detractor is the treatment/toning, which is too purple for my taste.  I''d love to see this in either color or a more neutrally toned b&w.  Nice capture nonetheless.', '2007-01-22 16:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267536, 456224, 55600, '<td valign="top">Background is disturbing</td>', 'Background is disturbing', '2007-01-22 16:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267537, 453777, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice detail and beautiful colors.</td>', 'Nice detail and beautiful colors.', '2007-01-22 16:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267550, 456435, 45519, '<td valign="top">Nice, gritty, old west feel to this shot ... which lends itself well to the subject.  A little more shadow detail in the face would be preferred (though perhaps tough given the dynamic range), and the composition makes the this large beast seem quite small actually ... you don''t get a sense of scale.</td>', 'Nice, gritty, old west feel to this shot ... which lends itself well to the subject.  A little more shadow detail in the face would be preferred (though perhaps tough given the dynamic range), and the composition makes the this large beast seem quite small actually ... you don''t get a sense of scale.', '2007-01-22 16:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267555, 455429, 45519, '<td valign="top">Almost painterly ... though perhaps a touch too much contrast.  Nice image.</td>', 'Almost painterly ... though perhaps a touch too much contrast.  Nice image.', '2007-01-22 16:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267558, 456696, 65234, '<td valign="top">Would find the wildlife much more interesting that the footprint, I think.  Just not much to see here.</td>', 'Would find the wildlife much more interesting that the footprint, I think.  Just not much to see here.', '2007-01-22 16:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267563, 454522, 27087, '<td valign="top">Talk about a mouth full of feathers, good shot</td>', 'Talk about a mouth full of feathers, good shot', '2007-01-22 16:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267565, 454946, 45519, '<td valign="top">I like the b&amp;w treatment: it''s a winter scene, it''s cold and stark, there''s little vegitation, etc.  I also like how all the geese are looking left, as if something is going on and they''re poised to go check it out.  Perhaps more effective use of the Channel Mixer could be employed, given Advanced Editing here, to draw the geese out further from their surroundings; as is they blend a bit too much IMO.  Nicely captured scene.</td>', 'I like the b&w treatment: it''s a winter scene, it''s cold and stark, there''s little vegitation, etc.  I also like how all the geese are looking left, as if something is going on and they''re poised to go check it out.  Perhaps more effective use of the Channel Mixer could be employed, given Advanced Editing here, to draw the geese out further from their surroundings; as is they blend a bit too much IMO.  Nicely captured scene.', '2007-01-22 16:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267582, 453762, 45519, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot.  I wonder how it would look with the foreground duck in focus?  My eye is definitely drawn to the ducks in the water (midground) due to good DOF, but I keep coming back to our little friend nearest us and wanting him to be the sharper subject.  nice scene.</td>', 'Lovely shot.  I wonder how it would look with the foreground duck in focus?  My eye is definitely drawn to the ducks in the water (midground) due to good DOF, but I keep coming back to our little friend nearest us and wanting him to be the sharper subject.  nice scene.', '2007-01-22 16:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267584, 456445, 43410, '<td valign="top">beautifully, and perfectly, framed...this is outstanding work</td>', 'beautifully, and perfectly, framed...this is outstanding work', '2007-01-22 16:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267585, 453377, 27087, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors, excellent detail I like it</td>', 'beautiful colors, excellent detail I like it', '2007-01-22 16:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
