(3267679, 456538, 45519, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  Love how the blue backdrop brings out the white and orange.  Excellent detail with little highlight clipping.  And is that blood on the feathers near the back/underside of the beak?  Ack!  Well done.</td>', 'Very nicely done.  Love how the blue backdrop brings out the white and orange.  Excellent detail with little highlight clipping.  And is that blood on the feathers near the back/underside of the beak?  Ack!  Well done.', '2007-01-22 16:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
