(3267704, 455658, 17990, '<td valign="top">Amazing image! first, I am telling you I am giving you a 9, `cause for much that I loooved it I can see little details that dont make this a perfect image... 1-the crop that cuts the right horn, and 2-a little halo around the horns (but actually, I do like halos... :P) anyway, I guess you are gonna do great! so good luck :D</td>', 'Amazing image! first, I am telling you I am giving you a 9, `cause for much that I loooved it I can see little details that dont make this a perfect image... 1-the crop that cuts the right horn, and 2-a little halo around the horns (but actually, I do like halos... :P) anyway, I guess you are gonna do great! so good luck :D', '2007-01-22 17:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
