(3267714, 456459, 13772, '<td valign="top">I like this one but I think it would be a little better if you was to lightn it some and could have gotten the whole bird in, wing tip to wing tip. The detail is nice. Good luck.</td>', 'I like this one but I think it would be a little better if you was to lightn it some and could have gotten the whole bird in, wing tip to wing tip. The detail is nice. Good luck.', '2007-01-22 17:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267720, 456359, 8860, '<td valign="top">These cheeky chappies have a special place in my garden. Cute!</td>', 'These cheeky chappies have a special place in my garden. Cute!', '2007-01-22 17:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267723, 456434, 45519, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and captured ... with good detail.  There''s a bit of residual evidence that the water portion has been photoshopped (likely darkened) as witnessed in the haloing around the duck and unaltered areas along the grassy horizon, especially lower right.  I only call attention to these details as feedback (not to be critical) because I believe digital enhancement should be seemless ... and this one is close.  If I didn''t spend so much time waist-deep in PS myself, I''d probably not be so particular. ;-)  *7*</td>', 'Nicely composed and captured ... with good detail.  There''s a bit of residual evidence that the water portion has been photoshopped (likely darkened) as witnessed in the haloing around the duck and unaltered areas along the grassy horizon, especially lower right.  I only call attention to these details as feedback (not to be critical) because I believe digital enhancement should be seemless ... and this one is close.  If I didn''t spend so much time waist-deep in PS myself, I''d probably not be so particular. ;-)  *7*', '2007-01-22 17:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267724, 455539, 45519, '<td valign="top">Fantastic!  Nice composition (love how the beaks are parallel), great detail and and lighting ... really wonderful scene.</td>', 'Fantastic!  Nice composition (love how the beaks are parallel), great detail and and lighting ... really wonderful scene.', '2007-01-22 17:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
