(3267741, 455681, 17990, '<td valign="top">Nice capture! anyway, I really like it but today I guess I am being over critical, and as people say they like constructive critisism I will let you a little of that... Theres a light yellow spot up the two (deers?) on the left, theres a blurry visible spot under the chest and beetween the legs of the deer at the right, and overly, I am feeling the image a little dark in the two middle animals.</td>', 'Nice capture! anyway, I really like it but today I guess I am being over critical, and as people say they like constructive critisism I will let you a little of that... Theres a light yellow spot up the two (deers?) on the left, theres a blurry visible spot under the chest and beetween the legs of the deer at the right, and overly, I am feeling the image a little dark in the two middle animals.', '2007-01-22 17:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
