(3267941, 456306, 69537, '<td valign="top">When I started voting last night, this actually didn''t show up at all. It''s a good thing I reconsidered checking. <br/> <br/>OH MY GOODNESS! This is one of the best capture of a deer that I have seen in my life. I hope to see this getting the BLUE RIBBON. Great texture on the deer, superb DOF but still managing to retain the details of the second deer on the right. Color treatment and lighting are also amazing. GREAT WORK!</td>', 'When I started voting last night, this actually didn''t show up at all. It''s a good thing I reconsidered checking.  OH MY GOODNESS! This is one of the best capture of a deer that I have seen in my life. I hope to see this getting the BLUE RIBBON. Great texture on the deer, superb DOF but still managing to retain the details of the second deer on the right. Color treatment and lighting are also amazing. GREAT WORK!', '2007-01-22 17:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267946, 456698, 62727, '<td valign="top">Wow! Perfect timing! 8</td>', 'Wow! Perfect timing! 8', '2007-01-22 17:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267951, 455226, 55837, '<td valign="top">He looks stuffed.  Is this from Cabela''s sporting goods store?</td>', 'He looks stuffed.  Is this from Cabela''s sporting goods store?', '2007-01-22 18:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267952, 455658, 62727, '<td valign="top">This is awesome!  10!</td>', 'This is awesome!  10!', '2007-01-22 18:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267959, 456511, 62727, '<td valign="top">Stunning! Do deer often walk on the beach?</td>', 'Stunning! Do deer often walk on the beach?', '2007-01-22 18:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267961, 454256, 66515, '<td valign="top">That is one fat goose! The shadow to her left has a strange blue hue to it. The straw is also exceptionally yellow. Perhaps a little oversaturated?</td>', 'That is one fat goose! The shadow to her left has a strange blue hue to it. The straw is also exceptionally yellow. Perhaps a little oversaturated?', '2007-01-22 18:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267964, 455541, 66515, '<td valign="top">Hmm..wild burros. :) In any event, I like this shot. Normally I don''t like it when the subject is looking out of the frame but its okay because both are doing it.</td>', 'Hmm..wild burros. :) In any event, I like this shot. Normally I don''t like it when the subject is looking out of the frame but its okay because both are doing it.', '2007-01-22 18:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267965, 456436, 62727, '<td valign="top">You are very brave! Nice capture! 8</td>', 'You are very brave! Nice capture! 8', '2007-01-22 18:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267966, 455085, 69537, '<td valign="top">The focus on your foreground is way stronger than your subject that it overpowered it. I wonder if this will look better if you cropped it tighter and eliminating the big rock on the left portion of the photo. I wish to see that as your outtake once the challenge is done. <br/> <br/>Good color but lighting is still on the strong side. <br/>I hope my comments help.</td>', 'The focus on your foreground is way stronger than your subject that it overpowered it. I wonder if this will look better if you cropped it tighter and eliminating the big rock on the left portion of the photo. I wish to see that as your outtake once the challenge is done.  Good color but lighting is still on the strong side. I hope my comments help.', '2007-01-22 18:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267967, 456195, 62727, '<td valign="top">Wow! 10</td>', 'Wow! 10', '2007-01-22 18:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267971, 454163, 69387, '<td valign="top">good clarity</td>', 'good clarity', '2007-01-22 18:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267972, 455832, 69387, '<td valign="top">Looks oversharpened. Good action shot.</td>', 'Looks oversharpened. Good action shot.', '2007-01-22 18:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267973, 455810, 69387, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot!</td>', 'Nice action shot!', '2007-01-22 18:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267979, 456194, 69537, '<td valign="top">Great 2-side framing. Very good focus, lighting  and color on the subject. Harsh light on the left is a little bit distracting but doesn''t take the quality out of a great capture.</td>', 'Great 2-side framing. Very good focus, lighting  and color on the subject. Harsh light on the left is a little bit distracting but doesn''t take the quality out of a great capture.', '2007-01-22 18:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267980, 456099, 69387, '<td valign="top">Great capture! I think the doe is sizing up the male deer''s goods ;)</td>', 'Great capture! I think the doe is sizing up the male deer''s goods ;)', '2007-01-22 18:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267981, 455411, 65234, '<td valign="top">The composition isn''t telling me a story, if that makes sense.  Not enough detail to give me any sense of the critters, no movement, and nothing in the way of interest in the background.  Not trying to be harsh and presumably they didn''t give you anything more interesting to shoot, but that''s my 2 cents.</td>', 'The composition isn''t telling me a story, if that makes sense.  Not enough detail to give me any sense of the critters, no movement, and nothing in the way of interest in the background.  Not trying to be harsh and presumably they didn''t give you anything more interesting to shoot, but that''s my 2 cents.', '2007-01-22 18:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3267983, 454073, 69387, '<td valign="top">Wow! This is nice. I wish the focus was more on the bird though. I like the editing.</td>', 'Wow! This is nice. I wish the focus was more on the bird though. I like the editing.', '2007-01-22 18:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
