(3269028, 455429, 63398, '<td valign="top">Let me say as someone who has been trying to take ONE decent shot of these things for about 35 years.....I HATE YOU! 9<br/> <br/>What a magnificent photograph......You should be very proud!</td>', 'Let me say as someone who has been trying to take ONE decent shot of these things for about 35 years.....I HATE YOU! 9 What a magnificent photograph......You should be very proud!', '2007-01-22 23:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3269046, 456125, 63398, '<td valign="top">A good pic, but it seems to have been hit pretty hard with some post processing that just doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'A good pic, but it seems to have been hit pretty hard with some post processing that just doesn''t work for me.', '2007-01-22 23:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3269054, 455896, 63398, '<td valign="top">Too much contrast, too busy, not clear enough.....nice capture, though....</td>', 'Too much contrast, too busy, not clear enough.....nice capture, though....', '2007-01-22 23:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3269059, 456764, 63398, '<td valign="top">Cute! Very nearly lost it to the sky light, didn''t you? A really difficult shot to have saved at all and it''s a very decent pic. I would have liked to have seen just the teensiest sharper detail.</td>', 'Cute! Very nearly lost it to the sky light, didn''t you? A really difficult shot to have saved at all and it''s a very decent pic. I would have liked to have seen just the teensiest sharper detail.', '2007-01-22 23:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3269065, 455999, 63398, '<td valign="top">Really terrific shot! Good light, good subject, good framing......7</td>', 'Really terrific shot! Good light, good subject, good framing......7', '2007-01-22 23:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3269074, 455683, 63398, '<td valign="top">Good capture!</td>', 'Good capture!', '2007-01-22 23:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3269079, 455890, 63398, '<td valign="top">Wow....what can I say? 10</td>', 'Wow....what can I say? 10', '2007-01-22 23:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3269085, 456511, 63398, '<td valign="top">Wow! What an awesome entry for Minimalism!!!!! It works here, too, but man! 8</td>', 'Wow! What an awesome entry for Minimalism!!!!! It works here, too, but man! 8', '2007-01-22 23:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3269095, 456145, 63398, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture......an outstanding job.....perfect processing and/or whatever you did  or didn''t do. I wouldn''t touch it on any level. ZERO flaws in my book. 9</td>', 'Excellent capture......an outstanding job.....perfect processing and/or whatever you did  or didn''t do. I wouldn''t touch it on any level. ZERO flaws in my book. 9', '2007-01-22 23:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3269096, 456309, 63398, '<td valign="top">I hate you! 10!!! I was feeling pretty good about my entry, then I saw this. 10!!! I hate you! I honestly say that there ia anything I would change about this pic. 10!!! I just hope you''re someone I know so I can rag you regularly. I hate you! 10!!!<br/> <br/>What an absolutely spectacular capture! Right to my favorites.</td>', 'I hate you! 10!!! I was feeling pretty good about my entry, then I saw this. 10!!! I hate you! I honestly say that there ia anything I would change about this pic. 10!!! I just hope you''re someone I know so I can rag you regularly. I hate you! 10!!! What an absolutely spectacular capture! Right to my favorites.', '2007-01-22 23:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3269103, 456698, 63398, '<td valign="top">What an outstanding capture!!!! 8</td>', 'What an outstanding capture!!!! 8', '2007-01-22 23:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3269110, 454163, 63398, '<td valign="top">Almost an exceptional pic......somehow I don''t think I really have to tell you that. Nice color, light, detail.....I love the eye and beak.</td>', 'Almost an exceptional pic......somehow I don''t think I really have to tell you that. Nice color, light, detail.....I love the eye and beak.', '2007-01-22 23:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3269128, 454729, 72530, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.</td>', 'Nice composition.', '2007-01-23 00:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3269137, 456391, 18367, '<td valign="top">Fantastic image... and either you have a very long lens or are unbelievably quiet in the bush. Great focus, fantastic DOF and considering the colours, I am amazed you managed to spot this beautiful specimen.  Well done.</td>', 'Fantastic image... and either you have a very long lens or are unbelievably quiet in the bush. Great focus, fantastic DOF and considering the colours, I am amazed you managed to spot this beautiful specimen.  Well done.', '2007-01-23 00:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3269140, 456747, 72530, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot, but looks more captive than wildlife.</td>', 'I like this a lot, but looks more captive than wildlife.', '2007-01-23 00:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3269142, 454524, 32968, '<td valign="top">A bit "hot" but still a nice shot. Less brightness would help. 6</td>', 'A bit "hot" but still a nice shot. Less brightness would help. 6', '2007-01-23 00:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3269146, 455890, 18367, '<td valign="top">A strikingly beautiful image of a truly beautiful specimen.  Well done indeed.</td>', 'A strikingly beautiful image of a truly beautiful specimen.  Well done indeed.', '2007-01-23 00:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3269147, 456434, 32968, '<td valign="top">I like the title. Nice crisp shot. 6</td>', 'I like the title. Nice crisp shot. 6', '2007-01-23 00:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3269157, 456015, 32968, '<td valign="top">Happy little duck! He looks like he''s smiling :) I think it could use more background, not so tight a crop. Maybe it''s just the reflections off the water that makes it seem like there''s no room for the duck. Nice details and colors</td>', 'Happy little duck! He looks like he''s smiling :) I think it could use more background, not so tight a crop. Maybe it''s just the reflections off the water that makes it seem like there''s no room for the duck. Nice details and colors', '2007-01-23 00:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3269158, 456173, 72530, '<td valign="top">Nice backlighting.</td>', 'Nice backlighting.', '2007-01-23 00:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3269165, 456002, 32968, '<td valign="top">Fantasy like. Very nice. I find myself wanting to see the rest of the animal, but this still works. It''d be lovely with some legs, and in a long slim crop. Nice catch either way. 7</td>', 'Fantasy like. Very nice. I find myself wanting to see the rest of the animal, but this still works. It''d be lovely with some legs, and in a long slim crop. Nice catch either way. 7', '2007-01-23 00:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3269176, 455502, 32968, '<td valign="top">No offense intended, but this has got to be one of the most awkward looking herons I''ve ever seen! The pic is great, maybe a bit tighter crop from the sides, but other than that I think it shows us that even the most graceful of birds, looks like a geek sometimes :) 6</td>', 'No offense intended, but this has got to be one of the most awkward looking herons I''ve ever seen! The pic is great, maybe a bit tighter crop from the sides, but other than that I think it shows us that even the most graceful of birds, looks like a geek sometimes :) 6', '2007-01-23 00:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3269196, 456179, 32968, '<td valign="top">Interesting "forward/backward" thing they''ve got going with their heads. Eyes on everything :) Could use a rotation to the left, just a bit. This would also look nice from the angle of directly down the rail, and a bit above the pelicans, looking down on them somewhat. 6</td>', 'Interesting "forward/backward" thing they''ve got going with their heads. Eyes on everything :) Could use a rotation to the left, just a bit. This would also look nice from the angle of directly down the rail, and a bit above the pelicans, looking down on them somewhat. 6', '2007-01-23 00:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3269200, 456446, 72530, '<td valign="top">ha ha!</td>', 'ha ha!', '2007-01-23 00:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3269205, 456306, 32968, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Was this done with HDR techniques? It almost looks as tho it was. The focus is centered right on the deer and her huge, dreamy eyes, and once your eyes wander to the background, they find interesting shapes back there too. Again, very nice and scoring high. Finished with a frame would score higher :) 9</td>', 'Very nice. Was this done with HDR techniques? It almost looks as tho it was. The focus is centered right on the deer and her huge, dreamy eyes, and once your eyes wander to the background, they find interesting shapes back there too. Again, very nice and scoring high. Finished with a frame would score higher :) 9', '2007-01-23 00:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3269209, 456767, 66201, '<td valign="top">Wow that''s close!!!</td>', 'Wow that''s close!!!', '2007-01-23 00:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3269211, 456702, 32968, '<td valign="top">Great perspective! Lovin'' the angle you''re on here.. Right in the trenches with the pidgeons, givin'' us a view of what they see. Cool :) 7</td>', 'Great perspective! Lovin'' the angle you''re on here.. Right in the trenches with the pidgeons, givin'' us a view of what they see. Cool :) 7', '2007-01-23 00:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3269219, 456231, 66201, '<td valign="top">What a pose: very elegant legs.</td>', 'What a pose: very elegant legs.', '2007-01-23 00:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3269225, 455881, 72530, '<td valign="top">Great detail in the bird. I would''ve edited/cropped out the people.</td>', 'Great detail in the bird. I would''ve edited/cropped out the people.', '2007-01-23 00:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3269226, 455983, 32968, '<td valign="top">I like the way you''ve captured the eagle but not the way the photo is cropped. This would look better with a narrower crop (right in half actually) to get rid of empty space, and a bit more background on the left side of the bird. 5</td>', 'I like the way you''ve captured the eagle but not the way the photo is cropped. This would look better with a narrower crop (right in half actually) to get rid of empty space, and a bit more background on the left side of the bird. 5', '2007-01-23 00:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3269238, 456316, 32968, '<td valign="top">Love the serene feel of this pic. Only two things to look at but sometimes simplicity works best. Would score higher with a frame. 9</td>', 'Love the serene feel of this pic. Only two things to look at but sometimes simplicity works best. Would score higher with a frame. 9', '2007-01-23 00:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3269242, 453582, 32968, '<td valign="top">A bit too much space on the left, but otherwise a great shot. 8</td>', 'A bit too much space on the left, but otherwise a great shot. 8', '2007-01-23 00:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3269252, 455268, 32968, '<td valign="top">Wow! Did you get a shiver when you saw that stare? I did :) Nice catch. They do add to the depth but the trees in the foreground are a bit distracting. None the less, great shot. 8</td>', 'Wow! Did you get a shiver when you saw that stare? I did :) Nice catch. They do add to the depth but the trees in the foreground are a bit distracting. None the less, great shot. 8', '2007-01-23 00:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
