(3270015, 456657, 6097, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot.  Nice control of the exposure.  Looks like this might have been a difficult shot to not blow out the highlights with the direct sun.  I like the warm golden tones this shot has.  Probably taken in the early morning?  Very cute and I like how it is looking back over it''s shoulder at you.  Good luck with the challenge!!!</td>', 'Excellent shot.  Nice control of the exposure.  Looks like this might have been a difficult shot to not blow out the highlights with the direct sun.  I like the warm golden tones this shot has.  Probably taken in the early morning?  Very cute and I like how it is looking back over it''s shoulder at you.  Good luck with the challenge!!!', '2007-01-23 06:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3270017, 456306, 71105, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  I like that you kept the one behind him in the shot.</td>', 'Very cool.  I like that you kept the one behind him in the shot.', '2007-01-23 06:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3270023, 456351, 6097, '<td valign="top">WOW!  Excellent capture!  So, how long have you been photographing for National Geographic?  Are they hiring?  LOL!!!  Really an awesome shot!  Great exposure and composition.  Nice colors in this shot also.  I like how they are just kind of ignoring you and not looking in to the camera as so many times animals do.  The fact that they aren''t staring you down makes the photograph feel that much more natural.  Good luck with the challenge!!!</td>', 'WOW!  Excellent capture!  So, how long have you been photographing for National Geographic?  Are they hiring?  LOL!!!  Really an awesome shot!  Great exposure and composition.  Nice colors in this shot also.  I like how they are just kind of ignoring you and not looking in to the camera as so many times animals do.  The fact that they aren''t staring you down makes the photograph feel that much more natural.  Good luck with the challenge!!!', '2007-01-23 06:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3270024, 455928, 71105, '<td valign="top">I like the look on his face.  He almost looks pissed that you''re taking his picture.</td>', 'I like the look on his face.  He almost looks pissed that you''re taking his picture.', '2007-01-23 06:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3270025, 455966, 71105, '<td valign="top">A little too sharp.</td>', 'A little too sharp.', '2007-01-23 06:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3270026, 456410, 71105, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!</td>', 'Nice shot!', '2007-01-23 07:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3270028, 455401, 6097, '<td valign="top">This shot look blurry to me and also overexposed and possibly like you made to much of an effort to try and sharpen it up.  I like the idea of the shot but I think the things I mentioned above really detract from the shot a little too much for me to be able to enjoy it.  Good luck with the challenge!!!</td>', 'This shot look blurry to me and also overexposed and possibly like you made to much of an effort to try and sharpen it up.  I like the idea of the shot but I think the things I mentioned above really detract from the shot a little too much for me to be able to enjoy it.  Good luck with the challenge!!!', '2007-01-23 07:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3270032, 456411, 6097, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and beautiful colors.  I see some detail in the featherers but the image also look like you maybe tried to over sharpen it a bit.  Not sure but that''s sort of how it look on my screen at least (which is calibrated).  It could also be the result of the image being downsized so much for the challenge too depending on the method you used but I''m not sure.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Nice composition and beautiful colors.  I see some detail in the featherers but the image also look like you maybe tried to over sharpen it a bit.  Not sure but that''s sort of how it look on my screen at least (which is calibrated).  It could also be the result of the image being downsized so much for the challenge too depending on the method you used but I''m not sure.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2007-01-23 07:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3270037, 456173, 48479, '<td valign="top">wow. great bokeh</td>', 'wow. great bokeh', '2007-01-23 07:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3270039, 456366, 6097, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and excellent exposure control to not blow out the whites in the face.  This is a really nice shot.  Beautiful bokeh and quite and interesting subject.  You have to love these little guys.  I suppose that''s why they are photographed so much.  Nice details in the featherers.  I''m so glad that you didn''t try to over sharpen the image which would have ruined it.  It''s sharp enough just as is, most likely because you are shooting with high quality glass.  Good luck with the challenge!!!</td>', 'Excellent composition and excellent exposure control to not blow out the whites in the face.  This is a really nice shot.  Beautiful bokeh and quite and interesting subject.  You have to love these little guys.  I suppose that''s why they are photographed so much.  Nice details in the featherers.  I''m so glad that you didn''t try to over sharpen the image which would have ruined it.  It''s sharp enough just as is, most likely because you are shooting with high quality glass.  Good luck with the challenge!!!', '2007-01-23 07:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3270045, 456473, 48479, '<td valign="top">nice snow drops. it helps give a sense of the cold</td>', 'nice snow drops. it helps give a sense of the cold', '2007-01-23 07:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3270050, 455634, 48479, '<td valign="top">postcard stuff. composition would be better if the sun was centred</td>', 'postcard stuff. composition would be better if the sun was centred', '2007-01-23 07:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3270052, 456434, 48479, '<td valign="top">great shot and nice composition</td>', 'great shot and nice composition', '2007-01-23 07:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3270054, 456305, 48479, '<td valign="top">that''s one fat cat</td>', 'that''s one fat cat', '2007-01-23 07:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3270059, 456433, 6097, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here and the swan in the background is very beautiful but the huge white line (snow?) going across the bottom of the photo is super distracting to me and draws my eyes there.  Perhaps a different crop removing that line would have worked better?  Just a thought...  Good luck with the challenge!!!</td>', 'I like the idea here and the swan in the background is very beautiful but the huge white line (snow?) going across the bottom of the photo is super distracting to me and draws my eyes there.  Perhaps a different crop removing that line would have worked better?  Just a thought...  Good luck with the challenge!!!', '2007-01-23 07:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3270067, 455810, 6097, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture.  The exposure is great and the clarity and sharpness I think are right on.  I''m glad you didn''t over sharpen the photo.  Interesting subjects and composition.  I like the little bit of bokeh and that the background can still be made out somewhat.  It is an interesting background that I think adds to the composition of the photograph.  Very nice color and tones in this photo.  Good luck with the challenge!!!</td>', 'Very nice capture.  The exposure is great and the clarity and sharpness I think are right on.  I''m glad you didn''t over sharpen the photo.  Interesting subjects and composition.  I like the little bit of bokeh and that the background can still be made out somewhat.  It is an interesting background that I think adds to the composition of the photograph.  Very nice color and tones in this photo.  Good luck with the challenge!!!', '2007-01-23 07:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3270070, 454246, 6097, '<td valign="top">Not sure what you were going for here but this is not within my taste.  Sorry!!!  Good luck!!!</td>', 'Not sure what you were going for here but this is not within my taste.  Sorry!!!  Good luck!!!', '2007-01-23 07:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3270074, 453582, 6097, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!!!  Very nice color.  Background is interesting and the bokeh is nice.  I like how you kept the rule of thirds in mind when composing this image.  I''m so glad he isn''t smack dab in the middle of the pic.  Good luck with the challenge!!!</td>', 'Beautiful!!!  Very nice color.  Background is interesting and the bokeh is nice.  I like how you kept the rule of thirds in mind when composing this image.  I''m so glad he isn''t smack dab in the middle of the pic.  Good luck with the challenge!!!', '2007-01-23 07:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3270078, 455890, 6097, '<td valign="top">All I can say is, WOW!!!  This is a beautiful image.  What a beautiful animal!  Beautiful eyes for sure.  Almost looks fake.  Isn''t mounted in some mountain store somewhere is it?  LOL!!!  Good luck with the challenge!!!</td>', 'All I can say is, WOW!!!  This is a beautiful image.  What a beautiful animal!  Beautiful eyes for sure.  Almost looks fake.  Isn''t mounted in some mountain store somewhere is it?  LOL!!!  Good luck with the challenge!!!', '2007-01-23 07:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
