(3270151, 456762, 32848, '<td valign="top">A photo of a squirrel, but not a particularly strong image. The picture is not very sharp and it''s a pity the eye has reflected the flash (if that is what caused it?). The branches both behind and in front of the subject are distracting. Having said all that I appreciate that getting closer was probably not an option! Certainly looks like a squirrels natural environment.</td>', 'A photo of a squirrel, but not a particularly strong image. The picture is not very sharp and it''s a pity the eye has reflected the flash (if that is what caused it?). The branches both behind and in front of the subject are distracting. Having said all that I appreciate that getting closer was probably not an option! Certainly looks like a squirrels natural environment.', '2007-01-23 08:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3270154, 456305, 32848, '<td valign="top">Great image of a fantastic creature.</td>', 'Great image of a fantastic creature.', '2007-01-23 08:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
