(3270261, 456194, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like how the background is sort of blanched out, like he''s appearing from a dream. Nice diagonal line/frame created by the tree branches.</td>', 'I like how the background is sort of blanched out, like he''s appearing from a dream. Nice diagonal line/frame created by the tree branches.', '2007-01-23 09:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3270264, 456306, 15711, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of a fav by yanko.  Love that you can see the other deer in the background.  They always have such cautious inquisitive expressions. I like the deepening of the shadow around the edge to pull the eye right to that sweet face. Bumping up.</td>', 'This reminds me of a fav by yanko.  Love that you can see the other deer in the background.  They always have such cautious inquisitive expressions. I like the deepening of the shadow around the edge to pull the eye right to that sweet face. Bumping up.', '2007-01-23 09:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3270268, 456351, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the natural feel of this. If it were mine, I might play with levels a bit, but that''s just me.  Very nicely composed. 7</td>', 'I like the natural feel of this. If it were mine, I might play with levels a bit, but that''s just me.  Very nicely composed. 7', '2007-01-23 09:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3270270, 453777, 15711, '<td valign="top">Classic. Nicely focused. Great lighting.</td>', 'Classic. Nicely focused. Great lighting.', '2007-01-23 09:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3270272, 454946, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like this. It gives us an entire vignette/scenario vs. just a closeup of the birds.  Nice diagonal line of the shoore with some added texture in the ice and the foreground. 7</td>', 'I like this. It gives us an entire vignette/scenario vs. just a closeup of the birds.  Nice diagonal line of the shoore with some added texture in the ice and the foreground. 7', '2007-01-23 09:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3270277, 454930, 15711, '<td valign="top">Really nice.  I like the neutral tones - very natural. The stop action is flawless. Maybe it doesn''t have the overall WOW factor, but it is certainly a well executed shot.  I can see this in a sporting life magazine.  I like the frame too.</td>', 'Really nice.  I like the neutral tones - very natural. The stop action is flawless. Maybe it doesn''t have the overall WOW factor, but it is certainly a well executed shot.  I can see this in a sporting life magazine.  I like the frame too.', '2007-01-23 09:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3270282, 456002, 15711, '<td valign="top">What a kinglike stance.  Love the focus and detail, although you aren''t that close. Great contrast, yet natural and neutral, just like in nature.  I like the background being enough in focus to see that he is in a forest of trees. Beautifully done.</td>', 'What a kinglike stance.  Love the focus and detail, although you aren''t that close. Great contrast, yet natural and neutral, just like in nature.  I like the background being enough in focus to see that he is in a forest of trees. Beautifully done.', '2007-01-23 09:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3270284, 455358, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has great appeal.  The linear quality stopped by the POPS of the yellow and black birds really works.  The yellow tones of the birdfeeder helps tie the color scheme together. Great DOF. Love the title.</td>', 'This has great appeal.  The linear quality stopped by the POPS of the yellow and black birds really works.  The yellow tones of the birdfeeder helps tie the color scheme together. Great DOF. Love the title.', '2007-01-23 09:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3270287, 456499, 68467, '<td valign="top">DMTC - remember non-domesticated animals only</td>', 'DMTC - remember non-domesticated animals only', '2007-01-23 09:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3270290, 456511, 15711, '<td valign="top">WOW - this image is just lovely. Love the misty setting. Either his diminutive stature will help of harm this.  I think it is glorious. Bumping up.</td>', 'WOW - this image is just lovely. Love the misty setting. Either his diminutive stature will help of harm this.  I think it is glorious. Bumping up.', '2007-01-23 09:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3270292, 455826, 15711, '<td valign="top">One of the better bird shots. I love the tilt of it with the diagonal line making for real interest. Perfect catch light in his eye.  8</td>', 'One of the better bird shots. I love the tilt of it with the diagonal line making for real interest. Perfect catch light in his eye.  8', '2007-01-23 09:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
