(3270297, 456311, 15711, '<td valign="top">It''s like a string of "M''s" and "V''s" in the sky.  Lovely tones.  It might not have the POW of a closeup, but it''s a classic.</td>', 'It''s like a string of "M''s" and "V''s" in the sky.  Lovely tones.  It might not have the POW of a closeup, but it''s a classic.', '2007-01-23 09:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
