(3270315, 455817, 15711, '<td valign="top">I am always so amazed at how tiny their eyes are in relationship to their huge majestic  bodies.  I like the use of negative space.  I wonder if it might have been more realistic if you could actually see a bit of contrast on the snow. I like that he has it on his chin.  Just thinking out loud. 7</td>', 'I am always so amazed at how tiny their eyes are in relationship to their huge majestic  bodies.  I like the use of negative space.  I wonder if it might have been more realistic if you could actually see a bit of contrast on the snow. I like that he has it on his chin.  Just thinking out loud. 7', '2007-01-23 09:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
