(3270334, 456762, 65234, '<td valign="top">The squirrel would stand out better with a shallower DOF.  What really stands out here is the glowing eye, which you could fix in advanced editing so it appeared natural.  I am guessing you used a flash and that''s the reflection.  Don''t know what equipment you have but a shallower DOF would also mean a faster shutter, which might let you avoid the flash and fixing its aftereffects.</td>', 'The squirrel would stand out better with a shallower DOF.  What really stands out here is the glowing eye, which you could fix in advanced editing so it appeared natural.  I am guessing you used a flash and that''s the reflection.  Don''t know what equipment you have but a shallower DOF would also mean a faster shutter, which might let you avoid the flash and fixing its aftereffects.', '2007-01-23 09:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
