(3270894, 454623, 66952, '<td valign="top">A cool (literally) moose! The color is a bit blue, which is easy to do in the snow on a cloudy day, since the light is bluer than normal. Taking care of the color cast would bring the moose more to life.</td>', 'A cool (literally) moose! The color is a bit blue, which is easy to do in the snow on a cloudy day, since the light is bluer than normal. Taking care of the color cast would bring the moose more to life.', '2007-01-23 13:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
