(3270917, 456318, 69368, '<td valign="top">i ask myself, where there are so many ducks? it could be still better if the ducks in the foreground on the right side would be sharper in the focus. Otherwise a nice shot!</td>', 'i ask myself, where there are so many ducks? it could be still better if the ducks in the foreground on the right side would be sharper in the focus. Otherwise a nice shot!', '2007-01-23 13:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3270921, 456511, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is the last photo I can vote on in this challenge:  Photo #217 out of 218, and I am SO GLAD I finished because this IS my favorite in the whole challenge!  I am wild about perspective shots showing the grandeur of a scene -- and that tiny little deer just MAKES this photo the spectacular photo it is!   Definitely adding it to my favorites, and it is 1 of only 4 10''s I gave in this fantastic challenge!  It is absolutely flawless not only technically, but in appeal and beauty as well!</td>', 'This is the last photo I can vote on in this challenge:  Photo #217 out of 218, and I am SO GLAD I finished because this IS my favorite in the whole challenge!  I am wild about perspective shots showing the grandeur of a scene -- and that tiny little deer just MAKES this photo the spectacular photo it is!   Definitely adding it to my favorites, and it is 1 of only 4 10''s I gave in this fantastic challenge!  It is absolutely flawless not only technically, but in appeal and beauty as well!', '2007-01-23 13:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3270924, 456306, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh this is beautiful!  I love that bokeh background with the faint hint of the other deer!   Awesome capture!!!</td>', 'Oh this is beautiful!  I love that bokeh background with the faint hint of the other deer!   Awesome capture!!!', '2007-01-23 13:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
