(3271172, 455766, 41337, '<td valign="top">I probably would have cropped more from the top but otherwise is very nice capture. The twinkles of light reflecting from the water really help to set the mood.</td>', 'I probably would have cropped more from the top but otherwise is very nice capture. The twinkles of light reflecting from the water really help to set the mood.', '2007-01-23 14:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
