(3271194, 456702, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice to see someone tackle a common subject and do something with it. I like everything about this and hope others do to.</td>', 'Nice to see someone tackle a common subject and do something with it. I like everything about this and hope others do to.', '2007-01-23 14:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
