(3271243, 456767, 67258, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty amazing photograph.  The perspective is quite simply unique - not many would have the guts to try it, I suspect - the composition is good, with plenty of the habitat visible to give context to the alligator (or crocodile?).  I really am very impressed.</td>', 'This is a pretty amazing photograph.  The perspective is quite simply unique - not many would have the guts to try it, I suspect - the composition is good, with plenty of the habitat visible to give context to the alligator (or crocodile?).  I really am very impressed.', '2007-01-23 15:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271250, 456654, 67258, '<td valign="top">The minute depth of field, whilst isolating the beetle , doesn''t really keep enough in focus.  Although there is detail in the dark area, it is quite hard to view.</td>', 'The minute depth of field, whilst isolating the beetle , doesn''t really keep enough in focus.  Although there is detail in the dark area, it is quite hard to view.', '2007-01-23 15:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271255, 455539, 67258, '<td valign="top">Super composition here.</td>', 'Super composition here.', '2007-01-23 15:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271265, 455634, 67258, '<td valign="top">Super.</td>', 'Super.', '2007-01-23 15:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271271, 456274, 24913, '<td valign="top">I think I would have cropped a little more off the top. Nice shot overall though</td>', 'I think I would have cropped a little more off the top. Nice shot overall though', '2007-01-23 15:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271283, 456323, 67258, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of the family grouping, but wish that the whole of the bull was in the frame - as it is, it doesn''t look quite balanced.  I might have been tempted to focus in on the mother and calf, who are beautifully posed. Nonetheless, an enjoyable photo to view.</td>', 'I like the idea of the family grouping, but wish that the whole of the bull was in the frame - as it is, it doesn''t look quite balanced.  I might have been tempted to focus in on the mother and calf, who are beautifully posed. Nonetheless, an enjoyable photo to view.', '2007-01-23 15:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271286, 456657, 67258, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous pose and expression, wonderful background bokeh.</td>', 'Gorgeous pose and expression, wonderful background bokeh.', '2007-01-23 15:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271288, 453762, 67258, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred the focus to be on the duck standing in the foreground, with it gradually tapering off towards the house.</td>', 'I would have preferred the focus to be on the duck standing in the foreground, with it gradually tapering off towards the house.', '2007-01-23 15:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271293, 456232, 67258, '<td valign="top">A good crisply focussed portrait, with an interseting pose, but let down slightly by the background.  I would have liked to have seen a little more of the macaw''s environs in order to give context to the photo.</td>', 'A good crisply focussed portrait, with an interseting pose, but let down slightly by the background.  I would have liked to have seen a little more of the macaw''s environs in order to give context to the photo.', '2007-01-23 15:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271297, 456445, 24913, '<td valign="top">Very nicely cropped!</td>', 'Very nicely cropped!', '2007-01-23 15:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271298, 456511, 24913, '<td valign="top">WOW what are the chances? Your lucky.</td>', 'WOW what are the chances? Your lucky.', '2007-01-23 15:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271300, 456165, 67258, '<td valign="top">I like that you chose this perspective - guess you must have been lying completely flat on the grass.  I am curious to know what length of lens you used; whatever it was, you have very successfully given the appearance of closeness and immediacy.</td>', 'I like that you chose this perspective - guess you must have been lying completely flat on the grass.  I am curious to know what length of lens you used; whatever it was, you have very successfully given the appearance of closeness and immediacy.', '2007-01-23 15:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271311, 456290, 67258, '<td valign="top">Golly, this looks bleak!  The three geese balance the composition well, but it is a bit of a shame something has crept into the very top of the frame - I would be tempted to crop it out.  I do wonder if the photo might be more successful if you adopted a lower vantage point?</td>', 'Golly, this looks bleak!  The three geese balance the composition well, but it is a bit of a shame something has crept into the very top of the frame - I would be tempted to crop it out.  I do wonder if the photo might be more successful if you adopted a lower vantage point?', '2007-01-23 15:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271318, 456285, 67258, '<td valign="top">Good composition, interesting and aesthetically pleasing pose of the two zebras, and a background giving context.  Good work.</td>', 'Good composition, interesting and aesthetically pleasing pose of the two zebras, and a background giving context.  Good work.', '2007-01-23 15:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271349, 456446, 67258, '<td valign="top">Very funny - needed a bit of humour to cheer me up, too!</td>', 'Very funny - needed a bit of humour to cheer me up, too!', '2007-01-23 15:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271354, 456134, 67258, '<td valign="top">Obviously not in the wild - unless you live somewhere where birds are nesting, and you had the foresight to set up nest cameras!  Nonetheless, a truly interesting photograph.  I look forward to reading what sort of bird this is, and the story behind the photo.</td>', 'Obviously not in the wild - unless you live somewhere where birds are nesting, and you had the foresight to set up nest cameras!  Nonetheless, a truly interesting photograph.  I look forward to reading what sort of bird this is, and the story behind the photo.', '2007-01-23 15:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271359, 456283, 67258, '<td valign="top">The gulls have rather got lost in this photo.  A narrower depth of field might have helped isolate them a little.  The alternative is waiting (and waiting, and waiting, if necessary) until they are closer to you so that they can feature more prominantly sizewise.</td>', 'The gulls have rather got lost in this photo.  A narrower depth of field might have helped isolate them a little.  The alternative is waiting (and waiting, and waiting, if necessary) until they are closer to you so that they can feature more prominantly sizewise.', '2007-01-23 15:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271362, 456292, 67258, '<td valign="top">Nice detail, but does seem a little over sharpened.</td>', 'Nice detail, but does seem a little over sharpened.', '2007-01-23 15:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271363, 456459, 43434, '<td valign="top">Great pic .. just a little dark.</td>', 'Great pic .. just a little dark.', '2007-01-23 15:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271368, 454620, 67258, '<td valign="top">A Muscovy duck?  They certainly are ugly, aren''t they!  You have got good crisp focus on the head area, but I rather wish you had got down lower, to the duck''s level.</td>', 'A Muscovy duck?  They certainly are ugly, aren''t they!  You have got good crisp focus on the head area, but I rather wish you had got down lower, to the duck''s level.', '2007-01-23 15:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271371, 456274, 67258, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous light, super background.  You were clearly up early, and it has paid off.  Lovely.</td>', 'Gorgeous light, super background.  You were clearly up early, and it has paid off.  Lovely.', '2007-01-23 15:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3271384, 456702, 18191, '<td valign="top">haha -- such a funny shot this is great! +fav</td>', 'haha -- such a funny shot this is great! +fav', '2007-01-23 15:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
