(3272032, 455918, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice detail and DOF.  He doesn''t look too securely perched, but not stressed about it.</td>', 'Nice detail and DOF.  He doesn''t look too securely perched, but not stressed about it.', '2007-01-23 18:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
