(3272629, 456758, 29770, '<td valign="top">Nice choice for a B&amp;W, although from the look of it, I bet the eyes are quite beautiful.  Nice image.</td>', 'Nice choice for a B&W, although from the look of it, I bet the eyes are quite beautiful.  Nice image.', '2007-01-23 21:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3272646, 456519, 29770, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and subject.  The background blur is very nice.  The only criticism I have is that the DOF looks to be to shallow to place the whole subject in focus.</td>', 'I like the composition and subject.  The background blur is very nice.  The only criticism I have is that the DOF looks to be to shallow to place the whole subject in focus.', '2007-01-23 21:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3272654, 456770, 29770, '<td valign="top">The eyes have it.  Great capture.  The lighting is nice and focus is very good.  Nice bokeh too.</td>', 'The eyes have it.  Great capture.  The lighting is nice and focus is very good.  Nice bokeh too.', '2007-01-23 21:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3272661, 455319, 29770, '<td valign="top">Not your average wildlife shot.  Nice to see something different here.  Great focus, lighting and bokeh.</td>', 'Not your average wildlife shot.  Nice to see something different here.  Great focus, lighting and bokeh.', '2007-01-23 21:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3272667, 456173, 29770, '<td valign="top">Nice backlight on the little sparrow.</td>', 'Nice backlight on the little sparrow.', '2007-01-23 21:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3272680, 456459, 29770, '<td valign="top">This shot looks too dark.  I would suggest adjusting curves or levels to bring out more detail.  I would also suggest trying to frame so that the wing is not cut off.  Sorry to only give the negative, but with a little work, this could be a nice image.</td>', 'This shot looks too dark.  I would suggest adjusting curves or levels to bring out more detail.  I would also suggest trying to frame so that the wing is not cut off.  Sorry to only give the negative, but with a little work, this could be a nice image.', '2007-01-23 21:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3272686, 455502, 29770, '<td valign="top">This could be a nice shot with a little more work.  The focus is a little soft.  A little more sharpening could help that.  I would also suggest a little different crop.  Maybe use the rule of thirds to place the subject a little more to the right, keeping both posts.</td>', 'This could be a nice shot with a little more work.  The focus is a little soft.  A little more sharpening could help that.  I would also suggest a little different crop.  Maybe use the rule of thirds to place the subject a little more to the right, keeping both posts.', '2007-01-23 22:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3272695, 456298, 29770, '<td valign="top">Looks like a little too much sharpening.  Otherwise the focus is good and the DOF helps the subject stand out.</td>', 'Looks like a little too much sharpening.  Otherwise the focus is good and the DOF helps the subject stand out.', '2007-01-23 22:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3272711, 456179, 60698, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and repetition of Pelicans with every other one turned in different direction. Great capture!</td>', 'Nice composition and repetition of Pelicans with every other one turned in different direction. Great capture!', '2007-01-23 22:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3272714, 456173, 60698, '<td valign="top">Nice detail and capture.</td>', 'Nice detail and capture.', '2007-01-23 22:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3272720, 456770, 60698, '<td valign="top">Absolutely love it!! Beautiful!</td>', 'Absolutely love it!! Beautiful!', '2007-01-23 22:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3272722, 455658, 60698, '<td valign="top">A work of art!</td>', 'A work of art!', '2007-01-23 22:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3272725, 456306, 60698, '<td valign="top">Wow! Nice DOF and PP!</td>', 'Wow! Nice DOF and PP!', '2007-01-23 22:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3272726, 456733, 60698, '<td valign="top">Wow! You can really sense the softness of the fur. A beautiful portrait.</td>', 'Wow! You can really sense the softness of the fur. A beautiful portrait.', '2007-01-23 22:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3272733, 455882, 60698, '<td valign="top">...and he looks a bit displeased. :) Wonderful capture and expert photography!</td>', '...and he looks a bit displeased. :) Wonderful capture and expert photography!', '2007-01-23 22:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
