(3272752, 456242, 60698, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful composition! Lighting is sooooo pretty and I love the sepia tones. He looks so kind and gentle.</td>', 'What a beautiful composition! Lighting is sooooo pretty and I love the sepia tones. He looks so kind and gentle.', '2007-01-23 22:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
