(3275139, 456459, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely detail (especially the tail feathers) but very dark on my monitor, and I wish you had caught the whole wing in the picture.  The crop on top feels especially odd with the wing cut off.</td>', 'Lovely detail (especially the tail feathers) but very dark on my monitor, and I wish you had caught the whole wing in the picture.  The crop on top feels especially odd with the wing cut off.', '2007-01-24 10:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
