(3276537, 453582, 65438, '<td valign="top">The color of the bird really pops against the brown background and draws your attention right to its face.  Like the composition. Excellent shot in my opinion.</td>', 'The color of the bird really pops against the brown background and draws your attention right to its face.  Like the composition. Excellent shot in my opinion.', '2007-01-24 16:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3276568, 455941, 65438, '<td valign="top">Too cute.  Love this.</td>', 'Too cute.  Love this.', '2007-01-24 16:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3276578, 456410, 65438, '<td valign="top">If this shot doesn''t get a ribbon I will be very surprised.  Like the glimmer in the eye and the detail of the mouth and water droplet.</td>', 'If this shot doesn''t get a ribbon I will be very surprised.  Like the glimmer in the eye and the detail of the mouth and water droplet.', '2007-01-24 16:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3276598, 455881, 65438, '<td valign="top">Great color and focus.  Hopefully people will realize how hard it is to get a good shot like this and not vote low due to the distracting people in the background.</td>', 'Great color and focus.  Hopefully people will realize how hard it is to get a good shot like this and not vote low due to the distracting people in the background.', '2007-01-24 16:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3276603, 455890, 65438, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, color, and focus.  This is sure to get a ribbon.  Beautiful.</td>', 'Great lighting, color, and focus.  This is sure to get a ribbon.  Beautiful.', '2007-01-24 16:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3276612, 456770, 65438, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Great focus and lighting.  Very crisp.</td>', 'Beautiful.  Great focus and lighting.  Very crisp.', '2007-01-24 16:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3276779, 456002, 45519, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait ... and nicely treated.  Really like this one.</td>', 'Excellent portrait ... and nicely treated.  Really like this one.', '2007-01-24 17:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3276819, 456475, 54479, '<td valign="top">This is a nice picture, but where''s the wildlife?</td>', 'This is a nice picture, but where''s the wildlife?', '2007-01-24 17:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3276838, 455146, 54479, '<td valign="top">It appears that something is wrong with the postprocessing.  Maybe there is too much contrast or sharpening.</td>', 'It appears that something is wrong with the postprocessing.  Maybe there is too much contrast or sharpening.', '2007-01-24 17:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3276847, 455049, 32848, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot of this wader. I would have preferred an off centre shot, but which way, I''m not sure. If the bird was on the right leaving space to move into you would have lost the disturbance of the water from its movement. On the left it would have had little space to move into. I can see why you centered it at the end of the day! Nice shot...</td>', 'Lovely shot of this wader. I would have preferred an off centre shot, but which way, I''m not sure. If the bird was on the right leaving space to move into you would have lost the disturbance of the water from its movement. On the left it would have had little space to move into. I can see why you centered it at the end of the day! Nice shot...', '2007-01-24 17:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
