(3276955, 456512, 66952, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this one, because I think there''s the start of something really good here. The roughness and texture of the water makes it look really cold and foreboding. But the treatment is just too dark, the head, neck, and chest of the duck just disappear into black. I think I would have gone with a square crop, too, to get the duck more into the middle of the frame, instead of swimming out of it.</td>', 'I keep coming back to this one, because I think there''s the start of something really good here. The roughness and texture of the water makes it look really cold and foreboding. But the treatment is just too dark, the head, neck, and chest of the duck just disappear into black. I think I would have gone with a square crop, too, to get the duck more into the middle of the frame, instead of swimming out of it.', '2007-01-24 18:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3276957, 454256, 54479, '<td valign="top">Love the title.</td>', 'Love the title.', '2007-01-24 18:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
