(3276995, 456747, 54479, '<td valign="top">I doubt he could be too lonely with all of the other animals in the zoo.</td>', 'I doubt he could be too lonely with all of the other animals in the zoo.', '2007-01-24 18:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
