(3278490, 456434, 51802, '<td valign="top">I really like the perspective of this shot. The DoF gives just enough detail of the water to keep it interesting, but not so much that it distracts from the duck.  Only flaw I see is that there is a halo around the duck that was probably created during post processing.</td>', 'I really like the perspective of this shot. The DoF gives just enough detail of the water to keep it interesting, but not so much that it distracts from the duck.  Only flaw I see is that there is a halo around the duck that was probably created during post processing.', '2007-01-24 23:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
