(3282273, 455995, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Good opportunity, like the majority of the poses captured, but wonder about a variation in angle or even cropping, but difficult.  Certainly a unique image, as well as scene.</td>', '6 - Good opportunity, like the majority of the poses captured, but wonder about a variation in angle or even cropping, but difficult.  Certainly a unique image, as well as scene.', '2007-01-25 17:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
