(3287056, 456511, 29011, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites from this challenge. Though the deer/fawn takes up such a small space in the shot, it has impact! Put it together with the beautiful natural surroundings and it just sparks. This is between a 9 and 10 from me, leaning more to the 10, just because my interpretation of wild life says I want to see the deer more close up. This is a capture which sparks the imagination and mind. Ok, a 10 it is.</td>', 'One of my favorites from this challenge. Though the deer/fawn takes up such a small space in the shot, it has impact! Put it together with the beautiful natural surroundings and it just sparks. This is between a 9 and 10 from me, leaning more to the 10, just because my interpretation of wild life says I want to see the deer more close up. This is a capture which sparks the imagination and mind. Ok, a 10 it is.', '2007-01-26 13:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3287071, 456762, 29011, '<td valign="top">The composition is good but not to keen on the flash reflection in it''s eye. Not an easy shot to focus on with the branches in the way, it is just a bit off. Good try, keep shooting :)</td>', 'The composition is good but not to keen on the flash reflection in it''s eye. Not an easy shot to focus on with the branches in the way, it is just a bit off. Good try, keep shooting :)', '2007-01-26 13:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
