(3288454, 456115, 69050, '<td valign="top">Your lucky that you have interesting animals like that to photograph. It seems like the picture was oof and you tried to sharpen to compensate but i think it was a little over-sharpened, which is probably whats hurting my eyes :P other than that its not really an interesting pose, you cant tell which end your looking at reallylol, you can see the one eye there but its just too lost in all the black and white. 4</td>', 'Your lucky that you have interesting animals like that to photograph. It seems like the picture was oof and you tried to sharpen to compensate but i think it was a little over-sharpened, which is probably whats hurting my eyes :P other than that its not really an interesting pose, you cant tell which end your looking at reallylol, you can see the one eye there but its just too lost in all the black and white. 4', '2007-01-26 19:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3288460, 456767, 58473, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, Steve I. would have been proud.</td>', 'Nice capture, Steve I. would have been proud.', '2007-01-26 19:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3288461, 456552, 69050, '<td valign="top">a little more use of DOF would make this a very intersting picture, unfortunaty the background is a tad distracting. a little more saturation inthe deer would make it pop, it seems a little under-saturated. Plus did you make use of the max pixels allowed? seems a little smaller than the rest, its always a good idea to use the max they allow, unless you made a really small crop and you dont wanna make it lose quality. 4</td>', 'a little more use of DOF would make this a very intersting picture, unfortunaty the background is a tad distracting. a little more saturation inthe deer would make it pop, it seems a little under-saturated. Plus did you make use of the max pixels allowed? seems a little smaller than the rest, its always a good idea to use the max they allow, unless you made a really small crop and you dont wanna make it lose quality. 4', '2007-01-26 19:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3288463, 456308, 69050, '<td valign="top">nice that you got a picture of it looking right at you. Onto the technical stuff, the nose (and some parts of the face) seem blown out, while the tip of the nose seems too dark, theres a oof branch on its back and is distracting, and the oof branch in the bottom right is also distracting. 5</td>', 'nice that you got a picture of it looking right at you. Onto the technical stuff, the nose (and some parts of the face) seem blown out, while the tip of the nose seems too dark, theres a oof branch on its back and is distracting, and the oof branch in the bottom right is also distracting. 5', '2007-01-26 19:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3288469, 456511, 69050, '<td valign="top">woah! I LOVE THIS! 10x a bajillion! the sky is perfect, the silloquette(?) is great, looks like she just got back from a nice dip in the ocean lol. There is perhaps a LITTLE haloing going on in the log near the bottom, but its not enough for me to like this picture any less. the saturation is perfect. A++, faved.</td>', 'woah! I LOVE THIS! 10x a bajillion! the sky is perfect, the silloquette(?) is great, looks like she just got back from a nice dip in the ocean lol. There is perhaps a LITTLE haloing going on in the log near the bottom, but its not enough for me to like this picture any less. the saturation is perfect. A++, faved.', '2007-01-26 19:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3288471, 456314, 69050, '<td valign="top">Get a room you two.</td>', 'Get a room you two.', '2007-01-26 19:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
