(3288476, 456698, 69050, '<td valign="top">Little more work with the light and darkness would help this. The face is blown out a bit, more contrast would help too, then maybe a little more saturation to bring out the water a tad.</td>', 'Little more work with the light and darkness would help this. The face is blown out a bit, more contrast would help too, then maybe a little more saturation to bring out the water a tad.', '2007-01-26 19:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
