(3289883, 455401, 72167, '<td valign="top">hard to comment on it, my glasses are dirty.... no, hang on, it''s a blurry photo.... not sure why people post these. This is an auto deleter!!</td>', 'hard to comment on it, my glasses are dirty.... no, hang on, it''s a blurry photo.... not sure why people post these. This is an auto deleter!!', '2007-01-27 02:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3289884, 454520, 72167, '<td valign="top">gawd...</td>', 'gawd...', '2007-01-27 02:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3289885, 456264, 72167, '<td valign="top">hmmm, blurry dark duck. Delete this one. Clearer and lighter is the key</td>', 'hmmm, blurry dark duck. Delete this one. Clearer and lighter is the key', '2007-01-27 02:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3289886, 456293, 72167, '<td valign="top">potential but no detail. Needs to be crystal clear to get a decent score.</td>', 'potential but no detail. Needs to be crystal clear to get a decent score.', '2007-01-27 02:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3289887, 456734, 72167, '<td valign="top">hmmmmmm . . . . .not sure what this is about. A Blurred ant in a white light?<br/>Insects are about detail, this is more abstract I guess.</td>', 'hmmmmmm . . . . .not sure what this is about. A Blurred ant in a white light?Insects are about detail, this is more abstract I guess.', '2007-01-27 02:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3289888, 456535, 72167, '<td valign="top">glare and shadows.<br/>point the camera away from the sun, add +1 EV for glare.<br/>could''ve been way better</td>', 'glare and shadows.point the camera away from the sun, add +1 EV for glare.could''ve been way better', '2007-01-27 02:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3289889, 456603, 72167, '<td valign="top">nice try, just too OOF for me.</td>', 'nice try, just too OOF for me.', '2007-01-27 02:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3289890, 456725, 72167, '<td valign="top">if it was clear, it''s a potential winner</td>', 'if it was clear, it''s a potential winner', '2007-01-27 02:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3289891, 456654, 72167, '<td valign="top">more DOF required. What little detail there is, is blurred or soft.</td>', 'more DOF required. What little detail there is, is blurred or soft.', '2007-01-27 02:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3289892, 455993, 72167, '<td valign="top">hmm..... deer with snow.....<br/>if we could see the deers head in detail this''d be OK</td>', 'hmm..... deer with snow.....if we could see the deers head in detail this''d be OK', '2007-01-27 02:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3289894, 453728, 72167, '<td valign="top">this should scream "detail" but barely makes a whisper. Take care to capture all of the precise detail on a bird and you''ll have the experts "wow"ing it.</td>', 'this should scream "detail" but barely makes a whisper. Take care to capture all of the precise detail on a bird and you''ll have the experts "wow"ing it.', '2007-01-27 02:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3289895, 455288, 72167, '<td valign="top">blurred Deer. Oh dear</td>', 'blurred Deer. Oh dear', '2007-01-27 02:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3289908, 454469, 34938, '<td valign="top">too small...sorry :-(</td>', 'too small...sorry :-(', '2007-01-27 02:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3289910, 456232, 34938, '<td valign="top">super sharp...needs some adjustments to make the colour really pop though</td>', 'super sharp...needs some adjustments to make the colour really pop though', '2007-01-27 02:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3289911, 456391, 34938, '<td valign="top">lovely light and nice colours and tones...very nice</td>', 'lovely light and nice colours and tones...very nice', '2007-01-27 02:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3289913, 456767, 72167, '<td valign="top">the best image i''ve seen yet. 10/10 from me!</td>', 'the best image i''ve seen yet. 10/10 from me!', '2007-01-27 02:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3289918, 456758, 34938, '<td valign="top">great as a B/W...I like the composition which has the wolf looking into the image...nice...</td>', 'great as a B/W...I like the composition which has the wolf looking into the image...nice...', '2007-01-27 03:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3289919, 456429, 34938, '<td valign="top">Love the clarity and the light...really pops...nice dof...good luck with this</td>', 'Love the clarity and the light...really pops...nice dof...good luck with this', '2007-01-27 03:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3289923, 455721, 34938, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t really see sheep as particularly wild...</td>', 'I wouldn''t really see sheep as particularly wild...', '2007-01-27 03:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3289926, 456770, 34938, '<td valign="top">nice light and quite sharp at 640mm...I like the composition but wonder what it would have looked like as a sq crop without the negative space on the right</td>', 'nice light and quite sharp at 640mm...I like the composition but wonder what it would have looked like as a sq crop without the negative space on the right', '2007-01-27 03:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3289927, 456366, 34938, '<td valign="top">lovely...great shallow dof, nice tones, crisp, great compsoition...you must be into bird photography as this is expertly done 8</td>', 'lovely...great shallow dof, nice tones, crisp, great compsoition...you must be into bird photography as this is expertly done 8', '2007-01-27 03:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3289928, 456242, 34938, '<td valign="top">it lacks contrast...with levels and curves this could have really popped...</td>', 'it lacks contrast...with levels and curves this could have really popped...', '2007-01-27 03:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3289929, 454052, 34938, '<td valign="top">some editing would have removed the mirkiness out of the water that gives this a real aquarium look...I like the composition though with the fish on the bottom third</td>', 'some editing would have removed the mirkiness out of the water that gives this a real aquarium look...I like the composition though with the fish on the bottom third', '2007-01-27 03:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3289930, 455983, 34938, '<td valign="top">a great sense of space and size...perhaps needs some levels adjustments and a crisper focus</td>', 'a great sense of space and size...perhaps needs some levels adjustments and a crisper focus', '2007-01-27 03:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3289934, 454620, 34938, '<td valign="top">nice sharpness...really nicely exposed as well</td>', 'nice sharpness...really nicely exposed as well', '2007-01-27 03:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3289935, 455049, 34938, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity of this...check out CUTTER''s profile and you will find a square cropped image that will turn your lights on! This one is great...what a pity they only give us 640 pixels...8</td>', 'I love the simplicity of this...check out CUTTER''s profile and you will find a square cropped image that will turn your lights on! This one is great...what a pity they only give us 640 pixels...8', '2007-01-27 03:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3289938, 455991, 34938, '<td valign="top">It''s just a messy image without a lot of detail to me...sorry :-(<br/> <br/>Focus is not quite there</td>', 'It''s just a messy image without a lot of detail to me...sorry :-( Focus is not quite there', '2007-01-27 03:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3289939, 456091, 34938, '<td valign="top">a great title and vantage point...light is perfect and so is the pose, you''ve really captured something special here 8</td>', 'a great title and vantage point...light is perfect and so is the pose, you''ve really captured something special here 8', '2007-01-27 03:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3289943, 456310, 34938, '<td valign="top">the auto focus seems to have focused on the shells at his feet...perhaps try manual focus in the future??? Nice image, but not quite there</td>', 'the auto focus seems to have focused on the shells at his feet...perhaps try manual focus in the future??? Nice image, but not quite there', '2007-01-27 03:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3289947, 456309, 16241, '<td valign="top">so sweet!  excellent title to.  top 3</td>', 'so sweet!  excellent title to.  top 3', '2007-01-27 03:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3289948, 456544, 16241, '<td valign="top">cute shot.</td>', 'cute shot.', '2007-01-27 03:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3289950, 456391, 16241, '<td valign="top">lovely</td>', 'lovely', '2007-01-27 03:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290228, 456511, 69684, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful atmosphere, but perhaps you should have rotated it a little.</td>', 'Very beautiful atmosphere, but perhaps you should have rotated it a little.', '2007-01-27 07:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290235, 455539, 69684, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors!</td>', 'Beautiful colors!', '2007-01-27 07:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290270, 455993, 69684, '<td valign="top">Not so sharp, but so beautiful!</td>', 'Not so sharp, but so beautiful!', '2007-01-27 07:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290276, 455991, 67258, '<td valign="top">The American robin is so very different to the European variety!</td>', 'The American robin is so very different to the European variety!', '2007-01-27 07:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290278, 456733, 67258, '<td valign="top">As a photo this is superb.  As an example of ''wildlife photography'' it would be completely and utterly amazing. I am not sure, ''though - I am reasonably confident that this was taken in a zoo, which in my view would go against <i>my</i> understanding of the intent of the <b>challenge</b>.  That said, I decided at the outset I would mark all photographs as if they were taken in the wild - I would absolutely hate to mark down a photo that I later discovered was  a true wildlife shot.</td>', 'As a photo this is superb.  As an example of ''wildlife photography'' it would be completely and utterly amazing. I am not sure, ''though - I am reasonably confident that this was taken in a zoo, which in my view would go against my understanding of the intent of the challenge.  That said, I decided at the outset I would mark all photographs as if they were taken in the wild - I would absolutely hate to mark down a photo that I later discovered was  a true wildlife shot.', '2007-01-27 07:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290281, 456544, 67258, '<td valign="top">What a perfect composition!</td>', 'What a perfect composition!', '2007-01-27 07:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290287, 455721, 67258, '<td valign="top">Yorkshire?  Not sure you could really call hill sheep ''wildlife'', but I do like the photo.</td>', 'Yorkshire?  Not sure you could really call hill sheep ''wildlife'', but I do like the photo.', '2007-01-27 07:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290290, 456306, 67258, '<td valign="top">Perfect.</td>', 'Perfect.', '2007-01-27 07:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290296, 456232, 12674, '<td valign="top">Handsome character, definitely a worthy subject, but maybe not for this challenge; doesn''t give sense of natural environment; you might want to experiment with more dynamic lighting - angles, brightness, etc.</td>', 'Handsome character, definitely a worthy subject, but maybe not for this challenge; doesn''t give sense of natural environment; you might want to experiment with more dynamic lighting - angles, brightness, etc.', '2007-01-27 07:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290298, 456309, 12674, '<td valign="top">Wow, you were positioned perfectly.  What a great shot! 10</td>', 'Wow, you were positioned perfectly.  What a great shot! 10', '2007-01-27 08:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290302, 456657, 12674, '<td valign="top">Great composition and isolation of subject. Very nice shot!</td>', 'Great composition and isolation of subject. Very nice shot!', '2007-01-27 08:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290307, 456553, 12674, '<td valign="top">Nice use of negative space. Sky feels a bit grainy - you might try Neat Image or similar tool for smoothing.</td>', 'Nice use of negative space. Sky feels a bit grainy - you might try Neat Image or similar tool for smoothing.', '2007-01-27 08:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290314, 456459, 12674, '<td valign="top">Nice subject, but could be brighter.</td>', 'Nice subject, but could be brighter.', '2007-01-27 08:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290316, 455502, 12674, '<td valign="top">Nice pose, but could be sharper.</td>', 'Nice pose, but could be sharper.', '2007-01-27 08:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290317, 455658, 20941, '<td valign="top">Wow! Lighting, focus, background... wonderful in every aspect I can think of! Awesome work! 10</td>', 'Wow! Lighting, focus, background... wonderful in every aspect I can think of! Awesome work! 10', '2007-01-27 08:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290325, 453534, 12674, '<td valign="top">I''m a bit confused by the composition. I figured out what it is but consider composing to make subject clearer.</td>', 'I''m a bit confused by the composition. I figured out what it is but consider composing to make subject clearer.', '2007-01-27 08:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290327, 456290, 12674, '<td valign="top">I like the snow piling up on their backs.  I suggest cropping the image closer to eliminate the object along top edge, increasing contrast, and sharpening a bit.</td>', 'I like the snow piling up on their backs.  I suggest cropping the image closer to eliminate the object along top edge, increasing contrast, and sharpening a bit.', '2007-01-27 08:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290329, 455937, 12674, '<td valign="top">This one really feels like wildlife - creepy looking critter! Nice capture.</td>', 'This one really feels like wildlife - creepy looking critter! Nice capture.', '2007-01-27 08:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290332, 456310, 12674, '<td valign="top">Nice composition with the acorns in the foreground. My favorite squirrel shot in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice composition with the acorns in the foreground. My favorite squirrel shot in the challenge.', '2007-01-27 08:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290336, 454729, 12674, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot of a really neat bird...and you got the pair!  Wonderful composition, background, and feel of the natural environment.</td>', 'Excellent shot of a really neat bird...and you got the pair!  Wonderful composition, background, and feel of the natural environment.', '2007-01-27 08:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290341, 455890, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Gorgeous light in/on the eyes.  Focus and clarity very good.</td>', '8 - Gorgeous light in/on the eyes.  Focus and clarity very good.', '2007-01-27 08:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290344, 456498, 12674, '<td valign="top">What a neat shot of an unusual habitat! The texture of the cactus dominates but eventually leads one to the cavity. Great shot!</td>', 'What a neat shot of an unusual habitat! The texture of the cactus dominates but eventually leads one to the cavity. Great shot!', '2007-01-27 08:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290350, 456311, 12674, '<td valign="top">It''s almost as if they''re trying to spell something. I really like the competing lines of the orange clouds and the birds.  A nice bold image!</td>', 'It''s almost as if they''re trying to spell something. I really like the competing lines of the orange clouds and the birds.  A nice bold image!', '2007-01-27 08:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290351, 455319, 6097, '<td valign="top">Very nice clear photograph.  I like the colors, tones and composition used.  I''m glad you didn''t do the ultra close up that is so popular today and decided to show the entire subject.  Looks nice and sharp but not over sharpened.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice clear photograph.  I like the colors, tones and composition used.  I''m glad you didn''t do the ultra close up that is so popular today and decided to show the entire subject.  Looks nice and sharp but not over sharpened.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2007-01-27 09:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290352, 456061, 6097, '<td valign="top">Great colors in the photo and great contrast against the background.  The bokeh is nice in the way that it allows the subjects head to stand out and be noticed that much more.  Interesting composition but I like it.  Nice and sharp but doesn''t feel over sharpened.  Nice capture!  Good luck with the challenge!!!</td>', 'Great colors in the photo and great contrast against the background.  The bokeh is nice in the way that it allows the subjects head to stand out and be noticed that much more.  Interesting composition but I like it.  Nice and sharp but doesn''t feel over sharpened.  Nice capture!  Good luck with the challenge!!!', '2007-01-27 09:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290354, 455966, 12674, '<td valign="top">My, what a beautiful creature - NOT!  Nice shot of that smooth red head.</td>', 'My, what a beautiful creature - NOT!  Nice shot of that smooth red head.', '2007-01-27 09:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290357, 456702, 12674, '<td valign="top">Tough guys... I like the "no humans" sign too as the central focus of color. The perspective really makes this shot.</td>', 'Tough guys... I like the "no humans" sign too as the central focus of color. The perspective really makes this shot.', '2007-01-27 09:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290358, 455766, 6097, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this image but feel that it is a bit over sharpened for my taste.  I think it just makes it feel to pixilated especially in the waves in the background.  Nice contrast of the bird against the water.  If I''m totally wrong about the artificial sharpening, I apologize but that''s what I''m perceiving.  Still a great photo and an impressive capture.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'I like the composition of this image but feel that it is a bit over sharpened for my taste.  I think it just makes it feel to pixilated especially in the waves in the background.  Nice contrast of the bird against the water.  If I''m totally wrong about the artificial sharpening, I apologize but that''s what I''m perceiving.  Still a great photo and an impressive capture.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2007-01-27 09:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290360, 456004, 12674, '<td valign="top">The sheer number of birds is impressive, like a Hitchcock movie.</td>', 'The sheer number of birds is impressive, like a Hitchcock movie.', '2007-01-27 09:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290362, 456762, 12674, '<td valign="top">Squirrel robots from outerspace...RUN!</td>', 'Squirrel robots from outerspace...RUN!', '2007-01-27 09:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290365, 455766, 12674, '<td valign="top">I really like the bokeh of the background - all the round sparkles. I wish I could see the subject a bit more clearly but I like it.</td>', 'I really like the bokeh of the background - all the round sparkles. I wish I could see the subject a bit more clearly but I like it.', '2007-01-27 09:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290370, 455928, 12674, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp image of the cardinal, and the goldfinch gives the image some depth.  I might''ve cropped a bit more tightly in landscape to reduce the amount of white sky in top left. I like it.</td>', 'Nice sharp image of the cardinal, and the goldfinch gives the image some depth.  I might''ve cropped a bit more tightly in landscape to reduce the amount of white sky in top left. I like it.', '2007-01-27 09:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290372, 454469, 12674, '<td valign="top">You''ll want to learn how to increase the image size and take full benefit of the challenge rules.  A larger image will better convey your subject and you''ll get higher scores.</td>', 'You''ll want to learn how to increase the image size and take full benefit of the challenge rules.  A larger image will better convey your subject and you''ll get higher scores.', '2007-01-27 09:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290379, 454946, 12674, '<td valign="top">Nice diagonal formed by geese with river/lake leading into distance.</td>', 'Nice diagonal formed by geese with river/lake leading into distance.', '2007-01-27 09:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290389, 456512, 12674, '<td valign="top">Nice composition but the image feels too dark to me.</td>', 'Nice composition but the image feels too dark to me.', '2007-01-27 09:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290395, 456318, 12674, '<td valign="top">The motion of all the ducks really conveys the pandemonium.  Nicely done!</td>', 'The motion of all the ducks really conveys the pandemonium.  Nicely done!', '2007-01-27 09:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290417, 456542, 7743, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette however the sky is a strange colour.</td>', 'Nice silhouette however the sky is a strange colour.', '2007-01-27 09:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290421, 456145, 7743, '<td valign="top">Good capture of these two little guys.  They may be slightly oversharpened and some of the backlit areas are blown out.</td>', 'Good capture of these two little guys.  They may be slightly oversharpened and some of the backlit areas are blown out.', '2007-01-27 09:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290424, 456702, 7743, '<td valign="top">Love the sign in the background.</td>', 'Love the sign in the background.', '2007-01-27 09:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290425, 456775, 7743, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and the red contrasts nicely with the green.  However, the focus on the cardinal seems a little soft compared to the focus on the juniper.</td>', 'Nicely composed and the red contrasts nicely with the green.  However, the focus on the cardinal seems a little soft compared to the focus on the juniper.', '2007-01-27 09:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290427, 455983, 7743, '<td valign="top">Love the composition and the use of negative space.  I think a little more contrast and the eagle would really pop.</td>', 'Love the composition and the use of negative space.  I think a little more contrast and the eagle would really pop.', '2007-01-27 09:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290433, 456290, 7743, '<td valign="top">I like the composition though the light seems to be a little flat.  I think more contrast would make the image pop.</td>', 'I like the composition though the light seems to be a little flat.  I think more contrast would make the image pop.', '2007-01-27 09:59:06.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3290434, 455049, 7743, '<td valign="top">Nice capture though I feel breaking the rule of ''space in front'' and cropping a bit off the left would make the image more dynamic as the bird would be more off center.</td>', 'Nice capture though I feel breaking the rule of ''space in front'' and cropping a bit off the left would make the image more dynamic as the bird would be more off center.', '2007-01-27 09:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290446, 455358, 6073, '<td valign="top">Way over worked.  Your birds have Halo''s around them.</td>', 'Way over worked.  Your birds have Halo''s around them.', '2007-01-27 10:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290468, 455358, 66952, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, but the post processing is a little over the top for my tastes.</td>', 'I like the composition, but the post processing is a little over the top for my tastes.', '2007-01-27 10:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290475, 455766, 66952, '<td valign="top">Maybe it''s a trick of the lighting or something, but is the bird''s head missing?</td>', 'Maybe it''s a trick of the lighting or something, but is the bird''s head missing?', '2007-01-27 10:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290476, 456702, 66952, '<td valign="top">An interesting and unusual perspective on wildlife. The angle of the shot is really interesting, but it makes getting a good shot really hard, because it''s too easy to blow out the sky. It might have worked better to shoot the pigeons in a more attractive setting, say in a park or on a statue.</td>', 'An interesting and unusual perspective on wildlife. The angle of the shot is really interesting, but it makes getting a good shot really hard, because it''s too easy to blow out the sky. It might have worked better to shoot the pigeons in a more attractive setting, say in a park or on a statue.', '2007-01-27 10:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290665, 456701, 7743, '<td valign="top">Woody is nice and sharp and in general the composition works quite well.  However, the bright area to the right of the bird, the OOF branch above and to a lesser degree the red twig poking in from the bottom left are distractions.</td>', 'Woody is nice and sharp and in general the composition works quite well.  However, the bright area to the right of the bird, the OOF branch above and to a lesser degree the red twig poking in from the bottom left are distractions.', '2007-01-27 11:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290856, 456767, 60698, '<td valign="top">Great composition and lighting! What a fine capture with his mouth opened like that!</td>', 'Great composition and lighting! What a fine capture with his mouth opened like that!', '2007-01-27 12:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290901, 456309, 19708, '<td valign="top">OMG - this is perhaps one of the best Egret shots I have ever seen!<br/>I expect to see this on the front page when this is over.<br/>Excellent stroke of luck being in the right place at the right time, and the technicals on this are first rate! Adding to my favorites.</td>', 'OMG - this is perhaps one of the best Egret shots I have ever seen!I expect to see this on the front page when this is over.Excellent stroke of luck being in the right place at the right time, and the technicals on this are first rate! Adding to my favorites.', '2007-01-27 12:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290905, 455658, 19708, '<td valign="top">I believe I am looking at the blue ribbon in this challenge.<br/>This is exceptional and a photograph I really would expect to see in a gallery.<br/>Adding to my favorites twice. <i>(well I tried anyway)</i></td>', 'I believe I am looking at the blue ribbon in this challenge.This is exceptional and a photograph I really would expect to see in a gallery.Adding to my favorites twice. (well I tried anyway)', '2007-01-27 12:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290906, 456519, 72581, '<td valign="top">I like how close up the cardinal is! The blurred backround looks good too. 8.</td>', 'I like how close up the cardinal is! The blurred backround looks good too. 8.', '2007-01-27 12:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3290912, 454524, 72581, '<td valign="top">I love the blurred backround with this pic! The bird is right in the center too!!!!!!!!!</td>', 'I love the blurred backround with this pic! The bird is right in the center too!!!!!!!!!', '2007-01-27 13:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
