(3291744, 456408, 50695, '<td valign="top">I love the division of the composition in half. Am I the only one? I''ll have to give you a 10, then. Honestly, you deserve it. the image has a lot of perspective, i.e. the front of the image is much closer than the back, but it looks utterly flat. this is an image I can keep coming back to and keep thinking about.</td>', 'I love the division of the composition in half. Am I the only one? I''ll have to give you a 10, then. Honestly, you deserve it. the image has a lot of perspective, i.e. the front of the image is much closer than the back, but it looks utterly flat. this is an image I can keep coming back to and keep thinking about.', '2007-01-27 17:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
