(3291843, 456747, 70270, '<td valign="top">I really like this image.  Nice use of the wall and the shadows to give context, and a great expression on the baboon.  Focus is a little soft, but I actually think that helps here.  You''re probably getting a lot of negative comments and down votes because it appears to be a zoo shot, but at least you didn''t try to hide it.  7.</td>', 'I really like this image.  Nice use of the wall and the shadows to give context, and a great expression on the baboon.  Focus is a little soft, but I actually think that helps here.  You''re probably getting a lot of negative comments and down votes because it appears to be a zoo shot, but at least you didn''t try to hide it.  7.', '2007-01-27 18:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
