(3295306, 455882, 22046, '<td valign="top">I like his direct stare. He is BIG!</td>', 'I like his direct stare. He is BIG!', '2007-01-28 22:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3295307, 456725, 6097, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  I only wish the beak were a little more sharp or in focus.  This would have also have been a good entry for the fill-the-frame challenge.  Good luck with the challenge!!!</td>', 'Nice capture.  I only wish the beak were a little more sharp or in focus.  This would have also have been a good entry for the fill-the-frame challenge.  Good luck with the challenge!!!', '2007-01-28 22:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3295314, 455988, 6097, '<td valign="top">WOW!  Super shot...  I like the tones you used here with all of the greens.  Very nice.  Nice details in this image.  Cute little fella.  Good luck with the challenge!!!</td>', 'WOW!  Super shot...  I like the tones you used here with all of the greens.  Very nice.  Nice details in this image.  Cute little fella.  Good luck with the challenge!!!', '2007-01-28 22:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3295322, 454623, 6097, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  Beautiful animal.  Whites feels a little blue to me though (I am using a calibrated monitor).  Could simply be that if you aren''t your that''s why.  Either way this is a nice image and the blue cast I''m seeing could be easily fixed.  Good luck with the challenge!!!</td>', 'Nice capture.  Beautiful animal.  Whites feels a little blue to me though (I am using a calibrated monitor).  Could simply be that if you aren''t your that''s why.  Either way this is a nice image and the blue cast I''m seeing could be easily fixed.  Good luck with the challenge!!!', '2007-01-28 22:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3295324, 453777, 6097, '<td valign="top">Very nice details in the feather and on the beak.  I''m really glad that you didn''t try to over-sharpen this image.  Sharpness, contrast, exposure and white balance all look really good.  Beautiful animal...  Good luck with the challenge!!!</td>', 'Very nice details in the feather and on the beak.  I''m really glad that you didn''t try to over-sharpen this image.  Sharpness, contrast, exposure and white balance all look really good.  Beautiful animal...  Good luck with the challenge!!!', '2007-01-28 22:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3295330, 454038, 6097, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  White balance is very good on my calibrated monitor.  Beautiful animal.  Looks like he found something good to chew on.  Very nice control over the exposure in this image.  This would have been very easy to have gotten wrong with all of the whites.  The animal is also very well exposed.  Nice job.  Good luck with the challenge!!!</td>', 'Very nice shot.  White balance is very good on my calibrated monitor.  Beautiful animal.  Looks like he found something good to chew on.  Very nice control over the exposure in this image.  This would have been very easy to have gotten wrong with all of the whites.  The animal is also very well exposed.  Nice job.  Good luck with the challenge!!!', '2007-01-28 22:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3295333, 455049, 6097, '<td valign="top">I really like the use of negative space here and the reflection is great.  The wake behind the bird is also a great touch and I think adds some forward motion to the pic, if that makes sense.  I do however see some dirt or something that looks like you may have image dust or something that could be easily fixed.  Nice job!  Good luck with the challenge!!!</td>', 'I really like the use of negative space here and the reflection is great.  The wake behind the bird is also a great touch and I think adds some forward motion to the pic, if that makes sense.  I do however see some dirt or something that looks like you may have image dust or something that could be easily fixed.  Nice job!  Good luck with the challenge!!!', '2007-01-28 22:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3295339, 453534, 6097, '<td valign="top">Super great photo.  Nice exposure and very nice detail.  Excellent subject and meets the challenge beautifully.  Great job!  Good luck with the challenge!!!  One of my favorites for the challenge!</td>', 'Super great photo.  Nice exposure and very nice detail.  Excellent subject and meets the challenge beautifully.  Great job!  Good luck with the challenge!!!  One of my favorites for the challenge!', '2007-01-28 22:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3295343, 455539, 6097, '<td valign="top">Very nice details in this image.  Beautiful subjects and nice composition.  Nice job...  Sharpness looks real good and I''m glad you didn''t attempt to over-sharpen.  Good luck with the challenge!!!</td>', 'Very nice details in this image.  Beautiful subjects and nice composition.  Nice job...  Sharpness looks real good and I''m glad you didn''t attempt to over-sharpen.  Good luck with the challenge!!!', '2007-01-28 22:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3295351, 456717, 6097, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot!!!  Great subtle colors and awesome sharpness.  Excellent capture!  Great work!  Good luck with the challenge!!!</td>', 'Very nice shot!!!  Great subtle colors and awesome sharpness.  Excellent capture!  Great work!  Good luck with the challenge!!!', '2007-01-28 22:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3295358, 456424, 6097, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot!  Excellent capture!  I really like the saturation you did with this and I think it made a very strong image.  I''m assuming you did a duo-tone type conversion?  It doesn''t look quite B&amp;W.  I''m glad it isn''t, I like the tones you used here.  Beautiful animal.  Sharpness looks really good.  Good luck with the challenge!!!</td>', 'Beautiful shot!  Excellent capture!  I really like the saturation you did with this and I think it made a very strong image.  I''m assuming you did a duo-tone type conversion?  It doesn''t look quite B&W.  I''m glad it isn''t, I like the tones you used here.  Beautiful animal.  Sharpness looks really good.  Good luck with the challenge!!!', '2007-01-28 22:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3295392, 456229, 62318, '<td valign="top">Nice focused image. The side lighting helps add texture to the animal. I think the composition needs to change a bit. It is a little too centered and too much negative space for this type of image. Seems like you are looking down on the animal rather than at eye level. Otherwise a good effort and a nice capture. Average rating.</td>', 'Nice focused image. The side lighting helps add texture to the animal. I think the composition needs to change a bit. It is a little too centered and too much negative space for this type of image. Seems like you are looking down on the animal rather than at eye level. Otherwise a good effort and a nice capture. Average rating.', '2007-01-28 22:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3295395, 454073, 62318, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of the framing here, maybe just a little more off the bottom? The exposure seems a little off, maybe a white balance issue. However, the bird is the main issue. I like the moment you capture the shot, great timing. Though I think the poor thing has been a bit over-processed or "zoomed" in a bit much. The detail is lacking. Average rating.</td>', 'I like the idea of the framing here, maybe just a little more off the bottom? The exposure seems a little off, maybe a white balance issue. However, the bird is the main issue. I like the moment you capture the shot, great timing. Though I think the poor thing has been a bit over-processed or "zoomed" in a bit much. The detail is lacking. Average rating.', '2007-01-28 22:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3295396, 455358, 62318, '<td valign="top">I love the color and contrast in this picture. Not sure about the wooden post, maybe a different angle? Also, so weird halo effect going on aroudn the birds. Average rating.</td>', 'I love the color and contrast in this picture. Not sure about the wooden post, maybe a different angle? Also, so weird halo effect going on aroudn the birds. Average rating.', '2007-01-28 22:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3295404, 454647, 62318, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors going on here. Both from the branches and the bird itself. I also like the moment you were able to capture the bird, the side look works well. I think the general composition is lacking. The background is a bit too busy, I think it would help to crop a bit more. Furthermore there is a branch eminating from the bird''s head which really takes away from the shot.</td>', 'I really like the colors going on here. Both from the branches and the bird itself. I also like the moment you were able to capture the bird, the side look works well. I think the general composition is lacking. The background is a bit too busy, I think it would help to crop a bit more. Furthermore there is a branch eminating from the bird''s head which really takes away from the shot.', '2007-01-28 22:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3295412, 455928, 62318, '<td valign="top">Colors are great in this photo. I think the photo is just too busy though, branches in front of the bird, and the other bird in the background. A little too centered for my taste. I also think a more uniform background woud have helped.</td>', 'Colors are great in this photo. I think the photo is just too busy though, branches in front of the bird, and the other bird in the background. A little too centered for my taste. I also think a more uniform background woud have helped.', '2007-01-28 22:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3295419, 456531, 62318, '<td valign="top">I think this is a case where it is either over-sharpened or cropped too much? I like the moment you caught the photo. The colors seems a bit muted, I would almost be tempted to change it to a B&amp;W photo. The photo just seems too "digital"</td>', 'I think this is a case where it is either over-sharpened or cropped too much? I like the moment you caught the photo. The colors seems a bit muted, I would almost be tempted to change it to a B&W photo. The photo just seems too "digital"', '2007-01-28 22:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3295426, 456293, 62318, '<td valign="top">I like how this is a portrait of a deer. You don''t see many straight on photos, so it is a nice change of pace. I am not sure of the exposure, or if you were tyring to go high-key, but it does not work for me. I also think the background is a big distraction. I would also be tempted to cut a little more off the top so it isn''t a centered. Still, it isn''t your typical wildlife shot, which I like.</td>', 'I like how this is a portrait of a deer. You don''t see many straight on photos, so it is a nice change of pace. I am not sure of the exposure, or if you were tyring to go high-key, but it does not work for me. I also think the background is a big distraction. I would also be tempted to cut a little more off the top so it isn''t a centered. Still, it isn''t your typical wildlife shot, which I like.', '2007-01-28 22:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3295435, 456355, 62318, '<td valign="top">I like the use of the frame and lines you have created with the tree and the creatures back. These work really well. I like the lighting attempt here and it is a good dynamic. I do think the background is a bit busy, as the blue sky circles seems to take a way a bit. I think the white balance might have been just a little off. The biggest issue though it is too sharp, as the scales look un-natural as they get closer to the camera.</td>', 'I like the use of the frame and lines you have created with the tree and the creatures back. These work really well. I like the lighting attempt here and it is a good dynamic. I do think the background is a bit busy, as the blue sky circles seems to take a way a bit. I think the white balance might have been just a little off. The biggest issue though it is too sharp, as the scales look un-natural as they get closer to the camera.', '2007-01-28 22:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3295440, 454729, 66597, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great capture and nice movement and composition between the herons. The only problems here are not-quite-sharp focus and colors look a little flat.</td>', 'I think this is a great capture and nice movement and composition between the herons. The only problems here are not-quite-sharp focus and colors look a little flat.', '2007-01-28 22:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3295443, 456701, 66597, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors on his head! Wouldn''t mind seeing a tighter crop, but understand you may have wanted to show more of his environment.</td>', 'Beautiful colors on his head! Wouldn''t mind seeing a tighter crop, but understand you may have wanted to show more of his environment.', '2007-01-28 23:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3295445, 456274, 66597, '<td valign="top">Simple and pretty with nice background and good DOF. Could be a little sharper.</td>', 'Simple and pretty with nice background and good DOF. Could be a little sharper.', '2007-01-28 23:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3295451, 456487, 66597, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tree frog. Lots of patterns going on here. On the one hand, they''re distracting. On the other, they help show how the frog blends into his environment. Interesting shot.</td>', 'Beautiful tree frog. Lots of patterns going on here. On the one hand, they''re distracting. On the other, they help show how the frog blends into his environment. Interesting shot.', '2007-01-28 23:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3295452, 455832, 66597, '<td valign="top">Pretty capture. Would like to see some lighter colors pulled out on heron.</td>', 'Pretty capture. Would like to see some lighter colors pulled out on heron.', '2007-01-28 23:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3295454, 456422, 66597, '<td valign="top">Light on gull''s breast is good with warm quality. Focus looks like it could be a little sharper, though.</td>', 'Light on gull''s breast is good with warm quality. Focus looks like it could be a little sharper, though.', '2007-01-28 23:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3295459, 456772, 66597, '<td valign="top">An interesting capture - not sure I''ve ever seen this kind of lizard? newt? skink? The big shadow under his head and shallow DOF don''t do him any favors, IMHO, but the most important thing - his eyes - are in focus, and the colors are really nice.</td>', 'An interesting capture - not sure I''ve ever seen this kind of lizard? newt? skink? The big shadow under his head and shallow DOF don''t do him any favors, IMHO, but the most important thing - his eyes - are in focus, and the colors are really nice.', '2007-01-28 23:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3295461, 454780, 66597, '<td valign="top">An interesting capture. Appreciate this new way of seeing a breat blue, as I frequently see them in my area.</td>', 'An interesting capture. Appreciate this new way of seeing a breat blue, as I frequently see them in my area.', '2007-01-28 23:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3295462, 456125, 66597, '<td valign="top">Good colors. Wish the wings were in a slightly different position to show more movement, though.</td>', 'Good colors. Wish the wings were in a slightly different position to show more movement, though.', '2007-01-28 23:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3295465, 455683, 66597, '<td valign="top">Nice, clean motion capture. Could be sharper with shorter DOF, but it works just fine.</td>', 'Nice, clean motion capture. Could be sharper with shorter DOF, but it works just fine.', '2007-01-28 23:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3295466, 456408, 66597, '<td valign="top">This is creative. I like how half of the space is opaque, the other half transparent. This type of photo tells a story, which very few photos do. Tecnically I think it could be a little stronger, but I think there is real artistry here.</td>', 'This is creative. I like how half of the space is opaque, the other half transparent. This type of photo tells a story, which very few photos do. Tecnically I think it could be a little stronger, but I think there is real artistry here.', '2007-01-28 23:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
