(3295471, 455721, 66597, '<td valign="top">Well, I really like this photo, though I''m not sure I would consider these wildlife. It has a nice feeling of movement. Will skip on voting.</td>', 'Well, I really like this photo, though I''m not sure I would consider these wildlife. It has a nice feeling of movement. Will skip on voting.', '2007-01-28 23:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
