(3297259, 456767, 50104, '<td valign="top">Mate, great shot, but you are seriously nuts. Those things can move soooooo quickly when they want to. Keep doing this and it''s only a matter of time before you lose an appendage, hopefully not your head.  Is it worth it???</td>', 'Mate, great shot, but you are seriously nuts. Those things can move soooooo quickly when they want to. Keep doing this and it''s only a matter of time before you lose an appendage, hopefully not your head.  Is it worth it???', '2007-01-29 05:51:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(3297268, 455890, 47852, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by xxrozxx:</b></div><hr/><i> just found out about this incredible photograph .. i''d missed it in the voting ..... average vote of 8.3000 .. not only a personal best and a blue ribbon .. but i think its very rare for anyone to get such an amazingly high score .......<br/>CONGRATULATIONS ..... <br/>could be a DPC record .. and if not it''d be close ......?? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Wow!  7th highest score ever on DPC... AMAZING!  Congrats!  And the 2nd place shot made the 11th highest ever.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-01-29 19:22:01.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by xxrozxx: just found out about this incredible photograph .. i''d missed it in the voting ..... average vote of 8.3000 .. not only a personal best and a blue ribbon .. but i think its very rare for anyone to get such an amazingly high score .......CONGRATULATIONS ..... could be a DPC record .. and if not it''d be close ......??   Wow!  7th highest score ever on DPC... AMAZING!  Congrats!  And the 2nd place shot made the 11th highest ever.', '2007-01-29 06:04:05.000000', '2007-01-29 19:22:01.000000', 0),
(3297270, 455658, 47852, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by legalbeagle:</b></div><hr/><i> And we were only talking about multiple 8+ contests the day before yesterday...!  <br/> <br/>Congrats on Red - bad luck that you came up against some superb competition!! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Multiple 8''s puts both the blue and red from this competition in the top shots ever on DPC.  Blue is 7th and this photo is 11th.  Incredible stats and some tough competition!  Congrats on a great accomplishment and photo!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-01-29 19:22:36.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by legalbeagle: And we were only talking about multiple 8+ contests the day before yesterday...!   Congrats on Red - bad luck that you came up against some superb competition!!   Multiple 8''s puts both the blue and red from this competition in the top shots ever on DPC.  Blue is 7th and this photo is 11th.  Incredible stats and some tough competition!  Congrats on a great accomplishment and photo!', '2007-01-29 06:10:04.000000', '2007-01-29 19:22:36.000000', 0),
(3297277, 455890, 20941, '<td valign="top">OH YEAH GIRL!!!! Knew you were overdue for a ribbon!! 8.3!!! Wow! This is so awesome!! I''m SO happy for you! Huge congratulations on your Blue and incredible score with this Outstanding shot!!</td>', 'OH YEAH GIRL!!!! Knew you were overdue for a ribbon!! 8.3!!! Wow! This is so awesome!! I''m SO happy for you! Huge congratulations on your Blue and incredible score with this Outstanding shot!!', '2007-01-29 06:20:36.000000', NULL, 0),
