(3297293, 455890, 34938, '<td valign="top">Susan, this has to be one of the top scores, if not the top, close to the top...congratualtions on a superb image and BLUE ...8.3!!! woah! That''s unbelievable</td>', 'Susan, this has to be one of the top scores, if not the top, close to the top...congratualtions on a superb image and BLUE ...8.3!!! woah! That''s unbelievable', '2007-01-29 06:28:01.000000', NULL, 0),
