(3297297, 456318, 30982, '<td valign="top">Also would have worked well for Fill the Frame.  Glad to see this was a Team Suck member - I thought it was indeed a pretty interesting take on the challenge.  Also pleasing to see that at least the commenters enjoyed the motion blur, too.  I like the single red foot in the upper right.</td>', 'Also would have worked well for Fill the Frame.  Glad to see this was a Team Suck member - I thought it was indeed a pretty interesting take on the challenge.  Also pleasing to see that at least the commenters enjoyed the motion blur, too.  I like the single red foot in the upper right.', '2007-01-29 06:29:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(3297307, 456767, 34938, '<td valign="top">Robert, I knew you would ribbon with this! Glad you managed to get your first ribbon...this is a dramatic hot...I am a HUGE wide angle fan, and this is one of the best around...PERFECT</td>', 'Robert, I knew you would ribbon with this! Glad you managed to get your first ribbon...this is a dramatic hot...I am a HUGE wide angle fan, and this is one of the best around...PERFECT', '2007-01-29 06:31:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(3297311, 455988, 30982, '<td valign="top">You and I must be on the same wavelength or something - seems I''m always taken with your shots in challenges.  Composition is very good with the strong diagonal and the green bokeh in the background is perfect for this shot.  Not quite a new PB but a new top row entry and a pleasing one to have there, too.</td>', 'You and I must be on the same wavelength or something - seems I''m always taken with your shots in challenges.  Composition is very good with the strong diagonal and the green bokeh in the background is perfect for this shot.  Not quite a new PB but a new top row entry and a pleasing one to have there, too.', '2007-01-29 06:33:58.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3297315, 456306, 34938, '<td valign="top">Congrats Richard...el Toro strikes again! Fantastic that you got a top 10 and a brilliant score to boost your average! Well done mate</td>', 'Congrats Richard...el Toro strikes again! Fantastic that you got a top 10 and a brilliant score to boost your average! Well done mate', '2007-01-29 06:36:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(3297320, 456770, 34938, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your top 10 Shannon...great shot, love the eye contact</td>', 'Congrats on your top 10 Shannon...great shot, love the eye contact', '2007-01-29 06:37:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(3297323, 456004, 30982, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the compliment!!  I''m quite flattered and I''m very delighted with the result you got.  I know I hate it when people say this but it really is woefully underrated.  I love the golden tones of the wings and the cacophony of flight you can almost hear from this photograph.  Lovely photograph!</td>', 'Thanks for the compliment!!  I''m quite flattered and I''m very delighted with the result you got.  I know I hate it when people say this but it really is woefully underrated.  I love the golden tones of the wings and the cacophony of flight you can almost hear from this photograph.  Lovely photograph!', '2007-01-29 06:38:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(3297324, 456002, 34938, '<td valign="top">WOW Sandy, you just missed the top 10 with a powerful image...you''ve been doing really well lately, keep it up...and a great score BTW</td>', 'WOW Sandy, you just missed the top 10 with a powerful image...you''ve been doing really well lately, keep it up...and a great score BTW', '2007-01-29 06:38:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(3297327, 453582, 34938, '<td valign="top">awesome Tim...great finish and a great score</td>', 'awesome Tim...great finish and a great score', '2007-01-29 06:42:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(3297329, 453534, 34938, '<td valign="top">totally, totally, totally underrated...this should have been in the top 10</td>', 'totally, totally, totally underrated...this should have been in the top 10', '2007-01-29 06:44:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(3297332, 455930, 34938, '<td valign="top">very underrated...this should have been right up on the front page</td>', 'very underrated...this should have been right up on the front page', '2007-01-29 06:45:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(3297385, 456769, 30982, '<td valign="top">Preserve or not, you definitely captured the "wild" essence of this beast in my opinion.  And what a gorgeous animal it is, too.  Also kinda neat the way that branch curves to reflect the curve of the wolf''s back and hindquarters.</td>', 'Preserve or not, you definitely captured the "wild" essence of this beast in my opinion.  And what a gorgeous animal it is, too.  Also kinda neat the way that branch curves to reflect the curve of the wolf''s back and hindquarters.', '2007-01-29 06:55:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(3297396, 456772, 53572, '<td valign="top">very nice image indeed, leah.  the composition and exposure are excellent.  the fucus is just right, on the eyes.  well done!</td>', 'very nice image indeed, leah.  the composition and exposure are excellent.  the fucus is just right, on the eyes.  well done!', '2007-01-29 06:58:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(3297412, 453762, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nearly a 6 and a nice shot, too!  Very peaceful - mist works well and the house adds a lovely element to show that wildlife does indeed coexist quite nicely with man.  Seems the majority of the commenters wanted to see the foreground duck a bit sharper.  It does work this way, though it requires the viewer to linger a bit longer to appreciate.  The "scene" is the house with the ducks in the water.  The "sentinel" is the single duck in the foreground, keeping an eye on things but not wishing to be the focal point.</td>', 'Very nearly a 6 and a nice shot, too!  Very peaceful - mist works well and the house adds a lovely element to show that wildlife does indeed coexist quite nicely with man.  Seems the majority of the commenters wanted to see the foreground duck a bit sharper.  It does work this way, though it requires the viewer to linger a bit longer to appreciate.  The "scene" is the house with the ducks in the water.  The "sentinel" is the single duck in the foreground, keeping an eye on things but not wishing to be the focal point.', '2007-01-29 07:00:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(3297420, 456769, 53572, '<td valign="top">a very nice image indeed.  the sense of menace is palpable.  the colours here work really well.  if the bottom left foreground were only slightly darker, that would help to bring the viewer''s eye to the wolf with more power and directness.<br/> <br/>well done.</td>', 'a very nice image indeed.  the sense of menace is palpable.  the colours here work really well.  if the bottom left foreground were only slightly darker, that would help to bring the viewer''s eye to the wolf with more power and directness. well done.', '2007-01-29 07:02:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(3297430, 454256, 30982, '<td valign="top">A very interesting perspective of a goose!  It definitely emphasizes their rotundness.  Processing is pretty good but you do have a bit of a blue cast to the snow which can be toned down a bit using selective color and/or hue sat.  I don''t mind it, though - kinda fits the picture nicely.</td>', 'A very interesting perspective of a goose!  It definitely emphasizes their rotundness.  Processing is pretty good but you do have a bit of a blue cast to the snow which can be toned down a bit using selective color and/or hue sat.  I don''t mind it, though - kinda fits the picture nicely.', '2007-01-29 07:03:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(3297444, 453762, 53572, '<td valign="top">very very pleasing shot, jeb.  the compostion is great, and i agree with deb, the foreground duck out of focus works well.  i''m not mad on the green border, though.  my eye keeps being drawn to that, rather than to the beautiful image it contains.<br/> <br/>o, and now i have ''dust in the wind'' stuck in my head...</td>', 'very very pleasing shot, jeb.  the compostion is great, and i agree with deb, the foreground duck out of focus works well.  i''m not mad on the green border, though.  my eye keeps being drawn to that, rather than to the beautiful image it contains. o, and now i have ''dust in the wind'' stuck in my head...', '2007-01-29 07:05:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(3297454, 456772, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a cute little guy!  I really like the very shallow DOF used here and the composition is very good with strong diagonals and the nice curve of the tail.</td>', 'What a cute little guy!  I really like the very shallow DOF used here and the composition is very good with strong diagonals and the nice curve of the tail.', '2007-01-29 07:05:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(3297473, 455890, 66709, '<td valign="top">congrats on your blue ribbon  I am one of the 72 gave you a 10.<br/> Maybe the person gave you a 1 don''t think is a wildlife shot.  this fox looks like a dog.</td>', 'congrats on your blue ribbon  I am one of the 72 gave you a 10. Maybe the person gave you a 1 don''t think is a wildlife shot.  this fox looks like a dog.', '2007-01-29 07:08:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(3297485, 454256, 53572, '<td valign="top">i like this, rosemary.  it''s a real portrait of the goose.  and the plumpness just comes right off the screen at you.  i like the blue snow (as you might be able to tell from my entry) so i have no problem with it, or your colour saturation.<br/> <br/>my only niggle is the blown snow in the top left corner.  it does somewhat compete with the goose for attention.<br/> <br/>nicely done!</td>', 'i like this, rosemary.  it''s a real portrait of the goose.  and the plumpness just comes right off the screen at you.  i like the blue snow (as you might be able to tell from my entry) so i have no problem with it, or your colour saturation. my only niggle is the blown snow in the top left corner.  it does somewhat compete with the goose for attention. nicely done!', '2007-01-29 07:11:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(3297509, 455890, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh Ivory!!!  I am so happy for you, and yes. . .this is the one I was sure would win blue and I hit that 10 button the minute I caught my breath and was able to take my eyes off this amazing photo!!<br/> <br/>That is about the highest score I think I''ve ever seen!   But its about the best photo I''ve seen too!<br/> <br/>MEGA CONGRATULATIONS!!!!!<br/></td>', 'Oh Ivory!!!  I am so happy for you, and yes. . .this is the one I was sure would win blue and I hit that 10 button the minute I caught my breath and was able to take my eyes off this amazing photo!! That is about the highest score I think I''ve ever seen!   But its about the best photo I''ve seen too! MEGA CONGRATULATIONS!!!!!', '2007-01-29 07:17:37.000000', NULL, 0),
