(3297514, 455658, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is also the one I had picked for 2nd place!  Those are some of my favorite animals -- and this is about the best photo of one I''ve ever seen!<br/> <br/>Congratulations -- man -- the voters dis an excellent job this time :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'This is also the one I had picked for 2nd place!  Those are some of my favorite animals -- and this is about the best photo of one I''ve ever seen! Congratulations -- man -- the voters dis an excellent job this time :) ', '2007-01-29 07:19:30.000000', NULL, 0),
