(3297544, 456445, 24454, '<td valign="top">Rita, CONGRATULATIONS on your first honorable mention with this amazing photo.   It was one of only 5 that I gave 10''s to and the others are ribbons &amp; 4th place!    It is a shame that such an amazing photo and a score that most assuredly would had won blue in any other challenge doesn''t get a ribbon as its reward -- but Honorable Mention and a 7.5 score.  Wow!  Everyone will be checking out that photo on your profile for a long long time :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Rita, CONGRATULATIONS on your first honorable mention with this amazing photo.   It was one of only 5 that I gave 10''s to and the others are ribbons & 4th place!    It is a shame that such an amazing photo and a score that most assuredly would had won blue in any other challenge doesn''t get a ribbon as its reward -- but Honorable Mention and a 7.5 score.  Wow!  Everyone will be checking out that photo on your profile for a long long time :) ', '2007-01-29 07:25:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(3297548, 455890, 36606, '<td valign="top">hey congrats on the all important BLUE. Great job</td>', 'hey congrats on the all important BLUE. Great job', '2007-01-29 07:26:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(3297552, 456767, 36606, '<td valign="top">Had this pegged for BLUE. What a find! congrats</td>', 'Had this pegged for BLUE. What a find! congrats', '2007-01-29 07:27:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(3297553, 456306, 24454, '<td valign="top">Richard, this was one of my favorites too!  AMAZING photography!  Amazing processing!   This photo is AWESOME!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Richard, this was one of my favorites too!  AMAZING photography!  Amazing processing!   This photo is AWESOME! ', '2007-01-29 07:27:10.000000', NULL, 0),
