(3297586, 456770, 24454, '<td valign="top">Your talent in making this shot happen like this is AMAZING!<br/> <br/>Congratulations on a top 10 reward for your efforts on this gorgeous photo!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Your talent in making this shot happen like this is AMAZING! Congratulations on a top 10 reward for your efforts on this gorgeous photo! ', '2007-01-29 07:34:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(3297591, 456542, 23484, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice shot. I especially like the clouds in this. They seem to have so much texture. DPC voters really hate anything where the color isn''t exact though. Good job.</td>', 'This is a very nice shot. I especially like the clouds in this. They seem to have so much texture. DPC voters really hate anything where the color isn''t exact though. Good job.', '2007-01-29 07:35:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(3297602, 455890, 68972, '<td valign="top">Such a captivating image!  CONGRATULATIONS!</td>', 'Such a captivating image!  CONGRATULATIONS!', '2007-01-29 07:40:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(3297603, 455358, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is great Jimmy!  What a great capture to find them all bright and yellow feeding at the same time like that!   I love how that shallow depth of field really makes those yellows jump out at you!<br/> <br/></td>', 'This is great Jimmy!  What a great capture to find them all bright and yellow feeding at the same time like that!   I love how that shallow depth of field really makes those yellows jump out at you! ', '2007-01-29 07:41:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(3297607, 454246, 67469, '<td valign="top">a good job. for what you had to work with,<br/>i recently got a great camera. before that i had a crap one.<br/>i know what it feels like.<br/> <br/>^-^</td>', 'a good job. for what you had to work with,i recently got a great camera. before that i had a crap one.i know what it feels like. ^-^', '2007-01-29 07:42:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(3297619, 456696, 51802, '<td valign="top">I am shocked that this ended up where it did.  Please don''t be discouraged by how narrow minded a lot of the voters here can be!  This really is a good photograph, and IMHO fits the challenge very well.</td>', 'I am shocked that this ended up where it did.  Please don''t be discouraged by how narrow minded a lot of the voters here can be!  This really is a good photograph, and IMHO fits the challenge very well.', '2007-01-29 07:54:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(3297625, 456002, 53147, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot Sandy! Congrats on the great showing amongst the amazing images.</td>', 'Beautiful shot Sandy! Congrats on the great showing amongst the amazing images.', '2007-01-29 07:58:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(3297628, 453762, 66597, '<td valign="top">Jeb, I know you are bummed because you barely missed that 6, but this is a really interesting shot, one of the most artistic of the challenge - a shot of which you should be proud! The mist is lovely and the intentional lack of focus on the foreground duck adds a lot of depth. Great job.</td>', 'Jeb, I know you are bummed because you barely missed that 6, but this is a really interesting shot, one of the most artistic of the challenge - a shot of which you should be proud! The mist is lovely and the intentional lack of focus on the foreground duck adds a lot of depth. Great job.', '2007-01-29 07:59:50.000000', NULL, 0),
