(3298388, 456115, 44877, '<td valign="top">Well, I suppose it was too abstract to score higher, though I still think it should have been at least in the top 20. It was definitely my pick for the top 3.</td>', 'Well, I suppose it was too abstract to score higher, though I still think it should have been at least in the top 20. It was definitely my pick for the top 3.', '2007-01-29 11:49:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(3298395, 456767, 58247, '<td valign="top">Holy crap you took this with a 12-24 Lens?! I would not have gotten that close! Great image though and you are quite ballsy. :-D</td>', 'Holy crap you took this with a 12-24 Lens?! I would not have gotten that close! Great image though and you are quite ballsy. :-D', '2007-01-29 11:51:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(3298402, 455890, 29591, '<td valign="top">Hey, great image. You are really on fire!! Great detail you can almost touch him.</td>', 'Hey, great image. You are really on fire!! Great detail you can almost touch him.', '2007-01-29 11:54:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(3298447, 456767, 30214, '<td valign="top">Amazing capture! Love the water drops on the teeth, and your perspective is unique. Maybe you are not THAT crazy to put your head to the viewfinder, but still pretty crazy to hold the camera with your own hands one foot from this mouth. Congrats on getting away with it, and with a well deserved ribbon to boot!</td>', 'Amazing capture! Love the water drops on the teeth, and your perspective is unique. Maybe you are not THAT crazy to put your head to the viewfinder, but still pretty crazy to hold the camera with your own hands one foot from this mouth. Congrats on getting away with it, and with a well deserved ribbon to boot!', '2007-01-29 12:10:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(3298452, 455810, 29293, '<td valign="top">very daring good catch!</td>', 'very daring good catch!', '2007-01-29 12:11:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(3298573, 454038, 7969, '<td valign="top">I think you should of done better, still a shot to be prooud of!</td>', 'I think you should of done better, still a shot to be prooud of!', '2007-01-29 12:47:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(3298615, 455658, 10720, '<td valign="top">Wow! Just wow, I love the what you have done in making this subject so dramatic. I didn''t both to enter this contest because all the animals here are brown, so I figured a brown and white would not ribbon. Boy did you prove me wrong, using the sky and the colors on the horns and just everything is perfection.</td>', 'Wow! Just wow, I love the what you have done in making this subject so dramatic. I didn''t both to enter this contest because all the animals here are brown, so I figured a brown and white would not ribbon. Boy did you prove me wrong, using the sky and the colors on the horns and just everything is perfection.', '2007-01-29 12:53:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(3298618, 455890, 10720, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting, and the expression! great detail!</td>', 'I love the lighting, and the expression! great detail!', '2007-01-29 12:54:44.000000', NULL, 0),
