(3298638, 454038, 10720, '<td valign="top">I really like the feeling of this one. I know the subject matter would have bothered some, plus the falling snow causing specks of light. Still I really like it.</td>', 'I really like the feeling of this one. I know the subject matter would have bothered some, plus the falling snow causing specks of light. Still I really like it.', '2007-01-29 12:58:56.000000', NULL, 0),
