(3301732, 454052, 65779, '<td valign="top">This was taken in the Two Oceans Aquarium in Cape Town, South Africa.  That fish IS big - about 2 ft long.  The kelp plants are probably about 1 storey high.<br/> <br/>The 4 DNMC votes I got were kind of expected and I don''t mind.  I did go out on a limb on this one as fish were not specifically mentioned in the challenge.  The competition was pretty stiff in this challenge so 86th is not too bad.</td>', 'This was taken in the Two Oceans Aquarium in Cape Town, South Africa.  That fish IS big - about 2 ft long.  The kelp plants are probably about 1 storey high. The 4 DNMC votes I got were kind of expected and I don''t mind.  I did go out on a limb on this one as fish were not specifically mentioned in the challenge.  The competition was pretty stiff in this challenge so 86th is not too bad.', '2007-01-30 02:25:25.000000', NULL, 0),
