(3303677, 456733, 39057, '<td valign="top">A GREAT shot in any aspect. It does not need to be taken in the wild. It is strange that a member would make the comment during voting calling this a "zoo shot" and then after the challenge making the same comment. It seems that he is just "throwing" in your face that he lives in the wild and you in the city.....very strange.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hahn23:</b></div><hr/><i> A fairly good zoo shot! </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'A GREAT shot in any aspect. It does not need to be taken in the wild. It is strange that a member would make the comment during voting calling this a "zoo shot" and then after the challenge making the same comment. It seems that he is just "throwing" in your face that he lives in the wild and you in the city.....very strange. Originally posted by hahn23: A fairly good zoo shot! ', '2007-01-30 15:54:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(3303704, 455890, 39057, '<td valign="top">Zoo shot? I wonder if Hahn23 voted you low on his preceived DNMC. This should be voted as you see it. IT DOES NOT MATTER IF YOU CAN SEE A BACKGROUND!<br/> <br/>This is an excellent shot even if if was taken in your living room.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hahn23:</b></div><hr/><i> Beautiful!  Where are your comments on location.  If this is a zoo shot, I''ll be really disappointed!  There is no environment showing, so it dnmc, unless you tell us this was shot in the wild.  Yes, I am challenging you here! </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Zoo shot? I wonder if Hahn23 voted you low on his preceived DNMC. This should be voted as you see it. IT DOES NOT MATTER IF YOU CAN SEE A BACKGROUND! This is an excellent shot even if if was taken in your living room. Originally posted by hahn23: Beautiful!  Where are your comments on location.  If this is a zoo shot, I''ll be really disappointed!  There is no environment showing, so it dnmc, unless you tell us this was shot in the wild.  Yes, I am challenging you here! ', '2007-01-30 16:01:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(3303706, 456194, 39057, '<td valign="top">Strange comment below....EXCELLENT SHOT in all aspects.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hahn23:</b></div><hr/><i> Great zoo shot! </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Strange comment below....EXCELLENT SHOT in all aspects. Originally posted by hahn23: Great zoo shot! ', '2007-01-30 16:02:51.000000', NULL, 0),
