(3303711, 456542, 39057, '<td valign="top">Cannot determine the environment? I hope he didn''t vote low because of that.....<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hahn23:</b></div><hr/><i> Silhouetted birds w/o detail.  Cannot determine natural environment. </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Cannot determine the environment? I hope he didn''t vote low because of that..... Originally posted by hahn23: Silhouetted birds w/o detail.  Cannot determine natural environment. ', '2007-01-30 16:07:09.000000', NULL, 0),
