(3304902, 454854, 72529, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hahn23:</b></div><hr/><i> Marking this down, after re-reading the challenge description.  No "natural environment" shown here.  So, dnmc! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Not a natural environment?  Wow, this guy must work for Nasa.  he must have been one of the people that faked the moon landing.  Hahn, you comment almost the same on everyones wildlife pics.  Do you think you are that great?  You have a problem, you think nobody else is as good as you.  You really need to get over yourself and see that there are many people more experienced than you.  I mean come on , you think these people took these pics in a zoo, and all along they took them in the wild, and are so good, they made think they were taken in a zoo.  Get real dude.</td>', 'Originally posted by hahn23: Marking this down, after re-reading the challenge description.  No "natural environment" shown here.  So, dnmc!   Not a natural environment?  Wow, this guy must work for Nasa.  he must have been one of the people that faked the moon landing.  Hahn, you comment almost the same on everyones wildlife pics.  Do you think you are that great?  You have a problem, you think nobody else is as good as you.  You really need to get over yourself and see that there are many people more experienced than you.  I mean come on , you think these people took these pics in a zoo, and all along they took them in the wild, and are so good, they made think they were taken in a zoo.  Get real dude.', '2007-01-30 22:32:00.000000', NULL, 0),
