(3312662, 455890, 64176, '<td valign="top">Gor-or-or-or-geous!  CONGRATS!!!!!  (and a little side note to everyone who assumed that this was not in the wild and voted your assumption, I would like to suggest that we all please be careful not to do that.  It''s not fair to the photographer in any challenge.  We have to trust that the photographer interprets the challenge as he or she sees fit and simply vote on the picture, not on the assumption.  it''s always dangerous to assume in any situation in life, because there''s always a 50% chance that we will be wrong.)</td>', 'Gor-or-or-or-geous!  CONGRATS!!!!!  (and a little side note to everyone who assumed that this was not in the wild and voted your assumption, I would like to suggest that we all please be careful not to do that.  It''s not fair to the photographer in any challenge.  We have to trust that the photographer interprets the challenge as he or she sees fit and simply vote on the picture, not on the assumption.  it''s always dangerous to assume in any situation in life, because there''s always a 50% chance that we will be wrong.)', '2007-02-01 10:41:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(3314131, 456696, 65886, '<td valign="top">excellent and a very clever idea! I love the title, too. <br/>this is so narrow-minded and ridiculous not to see it as wildlife. this is sad, but it''s great you entered it anyway!!</td>', 'excellent and a very clever idea! I love the title, too. this is so narrow-minded and ridiculous not to see it as wildlife. this is sad, but it''s great you entered it anyway!!', '2007-02-01 15:56:52.000000', NULL, 0),
