(5635462, 455890, 24666, '<td valign="top">this is a wonderful photo , didn''t vote on the challenge but most certainly would have given this a 10.<br/>the colours and the detail are absolutely amazing , focus and sharpness spot on , well done.</td>', 'this is a wonderful photo , didn''t vote on the challenge but most certainly would have given this a 10.the colours and the detail are absolutely amazing , focus and sharpness spot on , well done.', '2009-09-04 09:05:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(5654231, 456723, 50578, '<td valign="top">Wow that is pretty close, Seals can get pretty rough.    Just curious which Bay you shot this at? I have only seen one very young seal on the rocks along the coast between Houghton Bay and Island Bay luckly I had my camera with me.  My next quest is to see the Penguins. I have been told that Breaker Bay early in the morning is the place to go. But I haven''t made it down there earlier than 10AM which apparently is too late for the Penguins.  I know Red Rocks is a good place for both seals and penguins but kind of difficult to get there. However I do plan to make it down there in the next month or so.</td>', 'Wow that is pretty close, Seals can get pretty rough.    Just curious which Bay you shot this at? I have only seen one very young seal on the rocks along the coast between Houghton Bay and Island Bay luckly I had my camera with me.  My next quest is to see the Penguins. I have been told that Breaker Bay early in the morning is the place to go. But I haven''t made it down there earlier than 10AM which apparently is too late for the Penguins.  I know Red Rocks is a good place for both seals and penguins but kind of difficult to get there. However I do plan to make it down there in the next month or so.', '2009-09-20 05:44:07.000000', NULL, 0),
